<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">TO43.SFM 15/10/2022 FM TOTELA FIRST DRAFT SENANGA ZAMBIA.</book>
  <para style="h">MALEKA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amajwi Malotu aga naga N’ola Maleka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maleka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Amajwi Malotu aga naga N’ola</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maleka</para>
  <para style="imt">INZIBAAZO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Joani Mukolobezi Aa Cenisa Mu Nzila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateu3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Joani1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Amatatikilo go Majwi Malotu ga Jesu Kilesite, Mwana Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Sinagwe ubu ku n'olelwe mwi buka lyo muboni Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Nasa tuma u mutumigwa uju nali tangize kwako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">uju na litangize uku cenisa inzila jako’<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Ijwi lya jojo a kugiliza mu mangusu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Mu cenise mu nzila jo Mfumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">Mugolole amanzila gakwe!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Joani mukolobezi kale akeza mu mangusu na tandaza inkolobezo jo kubanga no kukwatila ibitendantu ibimangoju. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Abantu bonse ba mu cilalanda ca Judeya naba ka bajoja mu munzi gwa Jelusalema, kale baja kuku kolobezigwa mulwizi lwa Jodani ku kalikumbilila ubumangoju bwabo kwakwe.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Joani mukolobezi ka jabele iciapalo naca sumigwa aboja bo kamele, mi nalizingite ulukaku lo mukumba mu munda jakwe no kujoja ukulya inziye no buci bwa mulugole. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Kame Joani ka tandaza natyo buti, “Mwishule lyangu kwasa keza jumwinya uju aniita ku nguzu, mi tanijelele nanga ukukotama no kushumu nuna utugozi twa kunshangu jakwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Ime kame ni mikolobeza komenzi, kono ije kuti na mi kolobeze ko Moya go Kucena.”<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa kolobezigwa no kujelekigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Mateu3.13–4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka3.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Kajejo inako Jesu naga zwa mu munzi gwa Nazaleta, ugu kaguli mu cilalanda ca Galilea, mi kale aka kolobezigwa kwa Joani mu lwizi lwa Jodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Ao naga bomboka bulyo mu menzi, kale abona igulu lijashamite, mi Umoya go kukoza sinagwe nu nziba nagu sezumuka kwiza kutula kwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ijwi kale lyazwa kwigulu lityo buti, “Nigwe Mwanangu ni shaka lwini kako nili jangele wawa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Ao Umoya kale gwa muindikiza no kumutwala mu mangusu, <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Mi kale akala mu mangusu amajuba go makumi gone, na jelekigwa kwa Satani. Mi nakele mukati ko bipagu bya mulugole. Mi amangiloi naga mutegeleze.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa kuga abaumpilili bakwe betanzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Mateu4.12-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka4.14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Joani aa sebala mutuli mu ntolongo, Jesu kale gaja ku cilalanda ca Galileya naja butandaza Amajwi Malotu ga Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />Kale atyo buti, “Inako najasiki,” “Umubuso gwa Nyambe segulikele afuwi! Cwale mubange mi muzumine Amajwi Malotu!”<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Jesu aa kajenda kwi kamba lye ziba lya Galileya, kale ga bona aba nkosi bobile, ba Simoni no Andiliyasi mwa ncegwe naba shonja utunyandi mwiziba ukuti gogo kaguli umusebezi gwabo go kujambula inswi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Cwale Jesu kale atyo kwabo buti, “Muni umpilile buti ni mizige mo kujambwila abantu.” <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Ao bulyo kale baleka utunyandi twabo no ku muumpilila.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Aa sala jendi kacekace kuja abuso, kale ga bona Jemusi mwana Zebediya, ne mwancegwe Joani naba kabakele nabo mubwato naba shogela utunyandi twabo. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Bwangu bwangu kale aba kuga, no kuleka isabo Zebediya mu bwato no baika bakwe, mi kale ba umpilila Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu atanda umoya umubi ku nkosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luka4.31-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Ao bulyo kale baja mu munzi gwa Kapenauma, mi ijuba lyo Nsabata ase lilasiki, Jesu kale akangina mu cinagoge no kutatika ukuziga amajwi ga Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Mi abantu kale bakomokwa lwini kwebi kaziga, ukuti kabaziga sinagwe muntu akwesi inguzu kame taa kakozete abazigi bo mulao.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Cwale momo mu Cinagoge mokali umukwame kakwesi umoya umubi mi kale akumba buti, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Jesu gwa Nazaleta, cinzi aa utupengisa? Kame ulakezi kutu jundisa? Nilizekelele ubukalile, nigwe go Kucena gwa Nyambe”<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Jesu kale ga mujukukila buti, “Ombelela zwa kwakwe!”<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Mi umoya umubi kale gwa mugwisikiza ansi jojo unkosi no kuzwa kwakwe nagu kumbagana mwijwi inene. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Abantu bonse kale bakomokwa lwini no kuli buzagula mukati kabo buti, “Cinzi ceci? Mulaonzi umuya gogu? Ko nguzu aa jukukila bulyo umoya umubi mi segula mushugwa!”<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Ao bulyo akakumbo ka Jesu kale ka jandulukila mwi longa lyonse lya Galileya.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa oza abantu abangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateu8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka4.38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Ao bulyo Jesu no baumpilili bakwe aa sebalazwi mu cinagoge, kale bakaja na Jemusi na Joani ku njugo ja Simoni na Andiliyasi. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Cwale umukwe gwa Simoni kame kalele, nalwala ielenge, ao bulyo kale bagambaguza Jesu bya jojo umulwele. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Mi kale amusenena no ku mukwata kwi ganja no ku muzimika, mi kale a lwaluka kwi elenge no kutatika ukubawa ibilyo.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Amatengu ijuba aa se lila kagwi, kale bamuletela abalwele bonse aba ka balwala, naba ka bakwesi amayauma. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Abantu bonse kale ba bunganina acinzi co njugo ja Simoni. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Jesu kale aoza abantu aba kabalwala amalwele ga andene andene, mi no kutanda imyoya mibi ku bantu, mi taa kaji zuminiza ukugamba cimwinya ukuti kajizi buti nini wawa.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa tandaza mwa Galileya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luka4.42-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Aa na bwaca amasikusiku ijuba nali sini ukun’atula, Jesu kale ga buka kuzwa mu njugo mi kale gaja genke ku cibaka ciombelele mulugole ku ka kumbila kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni naba kakele nabo mu njugo kale bakaja ku kashaka Jesu, <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />aa sebala mugwani kale bamulugwila buti, “Abantu bonse kame bakushaka.”<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Jesu kale aba taba buti, “Ndokweni tu jende ku minzi ji mwinya nika zige, ukuti zezo nana kezela.”<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Jesu no ba umpilili bakwe kale ba zimbuluka mu cilalanda ca Galileya, na batandaza mu macinagoge gabo no kutanda amayauma.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa oza umukwame gwe cisenda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateu8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka5.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Umukwame uju kalwala icisenda kale geza kwa Jesu no kwiza kutongama noku kumbila buti, “Ati ulashaka,” “Ulagola ukuni cenisa.”<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Jesu kale ga mufwila inse, no kugolola iganja lyakwe no kukwata jojo umukwame. Kale gamuta buti, “Nila shaka,” “Ula cenisigwi.” <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Ao bulyo icisenda kale ca mumana, mi kale ga cenisigwa. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Mi Jesu kale gamuta buti ajende, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />mi kale atyo kwakwe buti, “Utegeleze, uleke ukugambaguza umuntu nanga genke. Kono ujende, uka libonaaze ku mupulisiti mi kabaka lyo ku cenisigwa, u inde ne citagilo ici naga mitela Mushe kabaka lyo kuceniswa kwako, buti bukabe ubumpaki bwako kwabo.”<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Nangaceciba, kale ga kaja bugambaguza abantu bu bunyangulukite no kujandulula igambagulo, mukutenda bobo, Jesu kale ga kangwa kungina mu munzi, kono ka kalanga bulyo kule ne minzi, mi abantu ka bazwa mu minzi jonse kwiza kwa Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa oza umukwame go kugolomena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateu9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka5.17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Aa se kulaiti amajuba, Jesu kale ga bogola kame kwa Kapenauma, mi abantu kale bashugwa buti alabogoli ku munzi. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Mi abantu kale ba gwanana mu bungi, mi mu ndandulu kale kwa bumba na anze onse, mi kale a tandaza ijwi kwabo. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Kale kwa keza abankosi bone aba ka ba kolekete unkosi go kugolomena no kumuleta kwa Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Kebaka lyo bungi bo bantu, kale bakangwa ku mutwala kwa Jesu, mi kale batulula akaito egulu lye cituwa umu kakele Jesu, mi aa na kwa tululigwa kale ba sezumukiseza ishasha ao kalele jojo unkosi. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Jesu aa salaboni intumelo jabo kale atyo ku nkosi go kugolomena buti, “Mwanangu ibibi byako bilakwatilwi.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Cwale abazigi bo mulao aba kabeke leo kale ba gaja mukati kabo buti, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Joju, cinzi aa gamba bobo? Kame anyungulula! Nini a botele uku kwatila ibibi? Tali ni Nyambe genke!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Bwangu bwangu Jesu mu Moya gwakwe, kale a ziba ibi ka ba gaja mu myojo jabo, mi kale a bata buti, “Cinzi aa mugaja byebo mu myojo jenu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Icitole cibo, uku lugwila uju a golomene buti, ‘Ibibi byako bila kwatilwi’ kampa nokutyo buti,’ ‘Zimana, uinde ubulo bwako ukaje?’ <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Kono nasa shaka muzibe buti, “Mwana Muntu ali kwesi inguzu jo ku kwatila ibi tendantu bimangoju aa no ansi.” Cwale kale atyo ku nkosi, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Nasa ku lugwila buti, zimana, uinde ubulo bwako u kaje ku munzi!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Abantu bonse kale babona jojo nkosi aa zimana, no kuinda ubulo bwakwe na kalijila, mi ceci kale ca komokisa abantu bonse mi kale balumba Nyambe buti, “Ta twala cibona icintu co kwikala bobo!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa kuga Livi Umutentesi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateu9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka5.27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Jesu kale a tungulula kame kwi ziba lya Galileya, mi abantu bonse kale ba keza kwakwe, no ku tatika ku baziga. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Aa kasijenda, kale a bona Livi mwana Alufeyasi na kele mwi ofisi jo batentesi. Mi kale a muta buti, “Ni umpilile munzila,” mi Livi kale a zimana no kumu umpilila.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Jesu aa ka kwesi kulya umu lalilo ku njogu ja Livi, ubungi boba tentesi nabo bitendantu ibi mangoju naba zigigwa bakwe kaba kwesi kulya naje ukuti ka bali bantu a bangi naba mu umpilila. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Abakulu bo mulao aa ba ka bali Bafalisi, aa babona Jesu nalya no batentesi nabo bitendantu ibi mangoju, kale batyo kuba zigigwa bakwe buti, “Cinzi Umfumu aa lya no ku nywa ne batentesi no bantu bo bitendantu ibi mangoju?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Jesu aa sala shugwi bobo, kale abata buti, “Aba ba baliketite taba shaki un’anga, kono aba balwala babo bashaka un’anga. Taa nana keza kwaba ba cenite, Kono kwa babo bo bitendantu ibi mangoju.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa bamubuza kazo kulinyima ibilyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateu9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka5.33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Aba umpilili ba Joani no ba umpilili bo bafalisi ka bali nyimanga ibilyo, abantu ba mwinya kale bakeza kubuza Jesu buti, “Cinzi ba zigigwa ba Joani na Bafalisi aa ba linyima ibilyo, kono aba umpilili bako taba linyimi ibilyo?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Jesu kale abetaba buti, “Abasele bo musesi bala gola ukuli nyima ibilyo uku musesi nasikele nabo? Taba goli uku linyima byo kulya uku nasikele nabo. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Kono inako kuti najisike umusesi aa naindigwe mukati kabo, mi kuti naba linyime ibilyo mwa lyelyo ijuba.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Takuli muntu agola ukun’atula ici kamba aci zwato ijiya no kacisumina aci zwato ici kulukulu ukuti ici kamba iciya kuti cin’atule iciya co kale, mi isuba kuti linenee lwini. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Kame ta kuli muntu agola ku gwanika iwaine impya na jo kale mutu zunga utu kulu kulu, aa ku tendigwa bobo, iwaine impya kuti ji n’atule utuzuga tokale. Kono iwaine impya ji sintilwe mu tuzunga utuya.”<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Impuzo ke juba lyo Nsabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateu12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka6.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Ijuba limwinya lyo Nsabata, Jesu kajenda mukati ko lugwa lo buloto. Aa ka bajenda bobo abazigigwa bakwe kale ba tatika kuulula ubweke bo buloto. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Mi Abafalisi kale ba mu buza buti, “Ngolole, cinzi aba zigigwa bako aa batenda ici taci botele mwijuba lyo Nsabata?”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Kono kale a ba taba buti, “Taa na mwa bala ibi naga tenda Deviti naba kakele nabo aa kaba fwite injala, <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />ubu naga nginina munjugo ja Nyambe mu majuba go Mupulisita umukulu Abiyatale, mi kale alya icinkwa <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Cinkwa Cigwanaala. Cisupo co nguzu ci gwanaala mu Tesitamente jo Kale ne cinkwa ici naca bikilwa mu Tabanekele ko cisupo co kugwanaala kwa Jesu</char></note>Cigwanaala ici taa kabotele ukulya, ici kaci botele kuligwa bulyo ku Mapulisita. Mi kale awa ko naa ba kakele nabo.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Jesu kale aba taba buti, “Ijuba lyo Nsabata muntu nalya tendelwa, isin’i muntu kutenda ijuba lyo Nsabata, <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Cwale Mwana Muntu nu Mfumu na lyo Nsabata.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu aoza nkosi gwe gaja lyo kugolomena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateu12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka6.6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Inako jimwinya Jesu aa ngina mu Cinagoge mo kakele unkosi go ku golomena iganja. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Ba mwinya kwabo kale ba mulolelela, buti ba bone bunga ala gola ku mu oza mwi juba lyo Nsabata buti bamuambike amataba. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Jesu kale atyo ku Nkosi go kugolomena iganja, “Gwize uzimane mukati ko bantu.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Cwale Jesu kale aba buza buti, “Cinzi cibotele kutendigwa lyo Nsabata kutenda ubulotu kampa kutenda ububi, kujojisa ubumi kampa kuiyaga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Kono kale ba ombelela takuli uju naga mutaba. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Jesu kale gaba logolosa muku nyegelwa, taa ka nyangulukite kabaka lyo myojo jabo imibi, kale atyo kwa jojo Nkosi, “Golola iganja lyako.” Kale gali golola ao bulyo no ku lwaluka. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Cwale Abafalisi kale bazwila kunze no kutatika kuli gamba guza neba Eloda ubu ba botele uku yagila Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubungi bo bantu aa baumpilila Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Jesu na bazigigwa bakwe kale baja kwi ziba lya Galileya, ubungi bo bantu aba ka ba zwa mucilalanda ca Galileya ne cilalanda ca Judeya kale ba mu umpilila. <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Aa sebala shugwi byonse ibi ka kwesi uku tenda, ubungi bo bantu kabazwa mu munzi gwa Jelusalema na mu cilalanda ca Idumeya na mubibaka bili kule no lwizi lwa Jodani ne kuminzi ja Tile na Sidoni. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Kebaka lyo bungi bo bantu, kale alugwila aba zigigwa bakwe buti ba mulukiseze ubwato bu nini kumbali buti, abantu baleke kumu bu nganina lwini. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Ukuti Jesu naga oza abantu bangi, aba ka ba kwesi a malwele kale ba litimbila timbila abuso buti baka mukwate. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Cwale imyoya imibi aa sejila muboni, kale ja gwila ansi abuso bwakwe no ku kumbagana buti, “Igwe uli Mwana Nyambe!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Kono Jesu kale a jukukila imyoya mibi, jileke uku lugwila abantu buti kali je.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu ashalula aba Positola bekumi nabobile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateu10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka6.12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Jesu akamba mina kwi lundu mi kale a kuga aba ka shaka, mi kale bakeza kwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Kale ashalula aba nkosi be kumi na bobile buti bakale naje, buti ala gola uku ba tuma kuku tandaza, <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Mukubawa inguzu jo ku tanda a mayauma.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Baba bekumi ne bobile naa a shalula, Simoni uju naga gulika izina lya Pitolosi na <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Jemusi mwana Zebedeya ne Joani mwancegwe gwa Jemusi, aba naga gulika izina lya Boaneligesi, intaluso, “Baana mvula azuma,” <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andiliyasi na Filipi na Batolome na Mateu na Tomasi na Jemusi mwana Alufeyasi na Tediyusi na Simoni gwa ku munzi gwa Kanana, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Mi na Judasi Isikaliote, uju naga legeza Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu alikwesi inguzu kuita Satani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mateu12.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Mi Jesu kale a ngina munjugo, mi abantu bangi kame kale ba gwanana buti ije na bazigigwa bakwe kale babula inako jo kulya. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Ba kwakwe ba Jesu aba shugwa zezo, kale bashaka a kaito ko ku muinda mi kabatyo buti, “Sala bulumuka!”<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Mi abazigi bo mulao aba kabazwa kwa Jelusalema kale batyo buti, “Ni nguzu ja Satani ji mukwesi nanga natanda amayauma, munguzu jo Mfumu gwa mayauma abitenda.”<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Cwale Jesu kale aba kuga no ku gambagula naboo mu manguli, “Buti Satani a golela kutanda Satani ju mwinya. <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Ukuti umulenen’i gonke guli lwisa gogo umulenen’i ta gugoli ku zimana. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Bantu bo njugo jonke aa balilwisa mwa cabo jejo injugo ta ji goli uku gongola. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Naje Satani alilwisa no kulitaya ije mwinyi tagoli ukugongola mingago ma ma ninino gakwe.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Cwale takuli u muntu uju agola uku ngina munjugo jo unkosi go nguzu no ka muibila, bwita kumu shumina tanzila asala mushumini cwale ko ku muibila.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />“Wawa nasa mi gambaguza buti, ububi bonse kuti nabu kwatilwe bana bantu antu onke nabi gambantu byabo bimangoju.” <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Kono gense uju agamba bu mangoju a Moya go Kucena taa na kwatilwe, ali kwesi u mulandu go cibi ugu ta gumani. <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Kagamba bobo ukuti buti ka batyo, “Moya mumangoju gumu kwesi.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bancegwe ba Jesu naba nyina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateu12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka8.19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Bancegwe ba Jesu naba nyina kale bakeza ku zimana kunze, kale ba tuma u muntu ku kakuga Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Ubungi bo bantu ka bekele naba zimbulukite Jesu kale ba muta buti, “Bancego naba nyoko kunze bali naba kushaka.”<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Kale ababuza buti, “Maa na bance bangu bani?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Mi kale alola babo kabakele bumu zimbulukite no kubata buti, “Nga mulole ba maa na bance gwangu baba ni kele nabo! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Mi umuntu gense uju atenda ici ashaka Nyambe ne mwancegwangu ne ncizi jangu kame na ba maa.”<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Inguli jo mubyali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateu13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka8.4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Jesu kale a tatika kame uku ziga abantu ekamba lye ziba. Bungi ubu ka bumu bunganine ka buli bunene, kebaka la bulyao, kale a ngina mubwato no ku kala mo. U bwato mu menzi ka bukele, mi bungi bo bantu kale ba sigala ekamba lye ziba. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Kale aba ziga ibintu bingi ko manguli, mi mu ku ziga kwakwe buti katyo,<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Mu ni tegeleze, u mulimi na gaja ku ku mwaga imbuto jakwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Aa ka kwesi ku mwaga imbuto bobo, jimwinya kale ja gwila mu nzila, mi ibijuni kale bya keza ku jilya. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Imbuto jimwinya kale ja gwila mwivu ice lyo tubwe, jejo mbuto kale ja kangwa uku mena bwangu, ukuti taa na ja noka lwini muku jimwaga. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Kono ijuba aa selila kambami, ibi nabya mena byonse kale bya linyonya ukuti taa kabi kwesi nenja imiisi. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Jimwinya imbuto kale ja gwila mu miga, mi imiga kale ja kula bwangu no ku kangwisa imbuto uku kula nenja, mi taa na ja tula bweke. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Jimwinya imbuto kale ja gwila mwivu lyo mununo, no kumena no kukula nenja mi kale ja mena bu gongwele no kuaka nenja. Ulubuto lonke kale lwa kata imbuto jo makumi go tatwe, jimwinya a makumi ga tosanwe ne kumi, jimwinya makumi ge kumi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Cwale Jesu kale aba lugwila buti, “Uju a kwesi a matwi go ku shugwa a shugwe.”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mugajalo go manguli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10">Mateu13.10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luka8.9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Mi Jesu aa kakele genke, bekumi na bobile na bamwinya abantu kale ba mubuza byo manguli ibi gatyo. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Mi kale aba lugwila buti, “Inwe na mwa wegwa a magano go mubuso gwa Nyambe,” Kono kwa babo aba bali kunze ibintu byonse mu manguli ba gambaguzwa, <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />kuti buti, “uku bona babone, kono baleke uku bonisisa, no kushugwa bashugwe, kono baleke uku shugwilisa, ati nabatenda bobo kame kuti naba bazoke, mi naba kwatile.”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa tansulula byo nguli jo mubyali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateu13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka8.11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Mi kale abata buti, “Ta mu shugwisisi jeji inguli? Cwale buti na mu shugwilise ama manguli ga mwinya? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Imbuto iji naja byaligwa nijwi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Abantu bamwinya ba kukoza sinagwe ni mbuto iji naja gwila munzila, ijwi aa libyaligwa kwabo, bwangu bwangu, Satani sala keza ku basigulula. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Bamwinya ba kukoza imbuto naja gwila mwivu lyo tubwe, bala shugwa ijwi no ku li tambula bu jangele. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Kebaka lyo kubula miisi kwabo, basa zumina bulyo inako imfui. Mi a mapenzi no makababu aa ga keza kebaka lyee jwi ba sa leka ku zu mina ijwi lya Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Bamwinya kame ba kukoza sinagwe ni mbuto naja gwili mu miiga, basa shugwa ijwi, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />kono baba abantu basa bilaezwa mubintu ba botele uku gwana mu bumi bwabo bwa mwi longa basa shaka kuba no lubono no kushaka ibi bintu bikeza mumilelo jo lubonwa. Kebaka lya byebi ibintu byonse taba sitambuli ijwi lya Nyambe ubu libotelelwe. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Bamwinya bantu bakukoza sinsgwe ni mbuto naja gwila mwivu lyo mununo, aa bashugwa ijwi no kuli tambula no ku kata imbuto indotu jimwinya makumi go tatwe, jimwinya makumi ga tosanwe ne kumi ji mwinya makumi ge kumi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inguli jo kambalambala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luka8.16-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Jesu kale aba buza buti, “Mu la gola ku fulumikila ilampi mu kasuba ko nkwaela kampa ku jitula mwisiko lyo bulo? Kampa mwasa jitula aa ku bonaala? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Ukuti takuli ici ntu ci libikite ici na cikane ku bonaala conse ici cili muluzinda kuti naci bibikuluke. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Uju akwesi amatwi go kushugwa ashugwe!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Mi Jesu kale anunga ko buti, “Mutegeleze nenja ibi mushugwa, intikanyo muwa nenwe ne ntikanyo namu wegwe mane no kuitilila. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Ukuti gense uju akwesi ibintu bingi kuti nawegwe mu bungi mi uju akwesi mubuce kuti na tapigwe conse ici akwesi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguli Je Mboto Jimena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Jesu kame kale ata buti, “U mubuso gwa Nyambe gwa kukoza sinagwe muntu naga mwagila imbuto mwigwa lyakwe, <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />nanga nalele amasiku no kubuka amasiku siku imbuto naji tumpila no ku likulila bulyo ubu ta zekelele. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Ivu lyasa letela imbuto kukala ici menantu iminsi jasa tatika ukumena kokeza umumeno imbuto cwale no kutatika kuaka kulusati. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Ao bulyo inako jo kuzimbula aa sejilasiki, umuzimbuli gasa inda akafulo no ku koshagula.<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguli jo mbuto ja masitete</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mateu13.31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka13.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Kale abalugwila buti, “Umubuso gwa Nyambe necinzi wawa ici saka tu gu kozanise? Kampa ni ngulinzi nzi iji saka tulitusise? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Go kukoza sinagwe ulubuto lo masitete ukuti aa lu byaligwa nalu nu nuwite lwini mwi mbuto jonse ja mwigwa. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Mi aa lubyaligwa lwasa kula no kuita ibi menantu byonse mu bunene mi ibijuni sebila jakila ibi jakilo kwintabi.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Jesu kagamba kwabo mu majwi mangi go ma nguli go kulikoza, buti a bantu ba shugwisise lwini. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Taa kagambagula bulyo kwabo uku tagambi mu manguli, kono kumbali aa ka kalanga genke na ba zigigwa bakwe kaba tolokelanga bintu byonse.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa ombeleza Inkuli ne Makupezi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateu8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka8.22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ijuba limwinya a matengu, Jesu kale a lugwila abazigigwa bakwe buti, “Ndokweni tu lutile mwi silya lye ziba.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Aa sebala leki abantu bonse, kale bangina mubyato naje Jesu no ku tatika kuzuga kuja mwisilya. Ko kabali bantu bamwinya kaba ba sindikiza no maato. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Kale kwa fukuka inkuli inene, mi a makupezi kale ga tatika ku ngina mu bwato, mi u bwato see ka bu bumba a menzi, buti mane see ka bu shaka kulobela. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Mi Jesu kame kalele kwishule lyo bwato na samite aciputu, mi bazigigwa bakwe kale ba mu busa buti, “Muzigi towene buti setulafwa?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Kale abuka no kujukukila inkuli no makupezi buti, “Ombelela!” Mi inkuli kale jaleka kuunga. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Jesu kale a lugwila bazigigwa bakwe buti, “Cinzi aa mula jogi lwini? Nashunwano tamukwesi intumelo?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Mi kale bajoga lwini no ku ligambaguza buti, “Nini joju unkosi, buti mane inkuli ne makupezi bi mushugwe!”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu aoza unkosi go mayauma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateu8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka8.26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Cwale kale bakasika mwisilya lye ziba mu cilalanda ca Gelaseni. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Jesu aa suka bulyo mu bwato, kale ashangana unkosi kakwesi umoya umubi nazwila ku mabita. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Joju unkosi kajoja ku mabita mi takuli uju ka gola kumu shumina nanga no mawenge. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Mwi nako ja ku mashule kaba jelekanga uku mushuminanga ama wenge ku maganja no kumushumina bitale ku matende, kono ka kosholanga a mawenge no ku colagula a mawenge mi kakwesi lwini inguzu buti takuli uju kamugola. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Inako jonse masiku ne kamwi kajoja ku mabita na ku malundu, na kumbagana no kuli kubaza ko mabwe.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Aa sala boni Jesu nasili kule, kale a mutigilila no katongama abuso bwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Kale alila no ku kugiliza buti, “Cinzi ubotele ku tenda kwangu Jesu Mwana Nyambe sakapanga? Mwizina lya Nyambe nasa ku kumbila uleke ku nipengisa.” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Kagamba zezi ukuti, “Zwa kwajoju unkosi gwe moya umubi!”<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Jesu kale amubuza, “Nigweni zina lyako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Mi kale ataba buti, “Izina lyangu nime Lijoni, ukuti tulibangi.” <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Mi kale a kumbila lwini lwini kwa Jesu buti a leke ku ji tandila kule ne cilalanda.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Ko kakuli icikutu co banjili ici kaciyangila afuwi ne lundu. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Amayauma kale ga kumbila Jesu buti, “Utu zuminine buti tukangine mu banjili.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Jesu kale aga zuminina, ao bulyo amayauma kale gazwa kwa jojo unkosi, no kangina mu ba ngili. Mi abanjili bonse kaba sika amyanda jobile kale ba butuka no ka sezumukila mwiziba no kafwila moo.”<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Abalisani aba kabalisa abanjili kale batiga no kagambaguza abantu ba mu minzi jafui ne mu malonga ga kumbali, mi abantu kale bakaja no kabona ici cilatendaali. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Aa bakeza kwa Jesu, kale ba keza kugwana jojo unkosi nakele na zwesi nenja buli ketite, unkosi uju kakwesi imyoya mingi, mi kale bajoga lwini. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Abantu aba naba bona ici na ca tendala, kale ba gambaguza ba mwinya jojo unkosi go mayauma ubu naga lwa lukila nobu naba tendela aba njili.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Mi abantu kale batatika ku kumbila Jesu buti azwe mucilalanda cabo.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Cwale Jesu aa sa la ngini mu bwato, jojo unkosi ka kwesi a mayauma kale a kumbila Jesu buti akaje nabo.<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Mi Jesu kale a mukanina no kumuta buti, “Ukaje ku munzi kuba kwako, u ka ba gambaguze ibintu binene ibi ala ku tendeli Umfumu no bu ala ku weli ici semo.”<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Mi jojo unkosi kale a kaja ku munzi gwakwe, naja bu gambaguza abantu mu minzi ja Dekapolisi ibi naga mutendela Jesu byonse, mi bonse kale ba komokwa.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana jailasi u mukazana no mukazi naga kwata ku mukanjo gwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateu9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka8.40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Jesu aa sala lutili kame mwi silya lye ziba ko bwato, ubungi bo bantu kale ba gwanana kwi kamba lye ziba. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Mi unkosi gwe zina lya Jailasi uju kali jumwinya mukulu gwa Cinagoge, aa sala boni Jesu, kale agwila afuwi na matende gakwe, <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />kale a mu kumbila wawa buti, “Muzigi, Mwanangu go mukazana sali senene ku kufwa, na sa ku kumbial buti ndoko uka mukwate buti a lwaluke no kujoja.”<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Cwale Jesu kale akaja naje, no bungi bo bantu kale ba mu umpilila bu mu bunganine.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Mi ko kali mwanakazi uju kalwala u bulwele bwe lowa mu myaka je kumi ne jobile (12). <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Naga pengiswa lwini mu ku angigwa ku ban’anga, naga jona ulubono lwakwe lonse ulu kakwesi, kono taa nalwaluka bulwele ko kulitwala twala. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Aa sa la shugwi za Jesu, kale a keza mwishule lyakwe mukati ko bantu no kukwata ku mukanjo gwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Ukuti buti katyo, “Ati nani kwata ku mukanjo gwakwe kuti ni lwaluke.”<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Ao bulyo ilowa lyakwe kale lya mana, mi kale a shugwa mu mubili gwakwe buti a mapenzi gakwe ga lamani. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Ao bulyo Jesu kale a shugwa buti inguzu ji lazwi kwakwe, mi kale a sigulukila ku bantu no kutyo, “Nini ala ni kwati ku mukanjo gwangu?”<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Mi abazigigwa bakwe kale ba muta buti, “To wene bungi bo bantu kame ba ku kumagula, kono igwe so la buza buti nini ala ku kwati?”<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Mi Jesu kale a logolosa bantu ku mensho buti a bone uju ala mukwati. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Cwale mwanakazi mu ku zekelela ici cila tendaali kwakwe, kale a keza ku gwila ku matende ga Jesu na tutuma bu jogite lwini no ku mugambaguza iconse. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Kono Jesu kale a muta buti, “Mwanangu, intumelo jako jila ku lwalukisi, u jende mu nkozo mi ula jojeswi mu mapenzi gako.”<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Jesu na sini ku mana uku gamba no mwanakazi, kale kwa keza abantu ka ba zwila ku njugo ja Jailasi, u mukulu gwa Cinagoge no keza ku mu ganbaguza buti, “U leke ku kataza muzigi, mwano go mukazana a lafwi.”<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Kono Jesu mu ku shugwa ibi ka ba gamba, kale agamba bobo kwa Jailasi, “Uleke ku joga, u zumine bulyo.” <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Mi kale a kanisa abantu uku mu umpilila, bwita Pitolosi, Jemusi na Joani mukwakwe gwa Jemusi. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Aa sebala kasiki kwilapa lya Jailasi, kale ashugwa ijaba lyo bantu bakwesi ku kumbagana no kulila. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Mi kale angina momo no kubata buti, “Cinzi aa mu kumbagana lwini no kulila? Umwanuke ta lafwi, kono bulyo alele.”<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Kono abo kale bamu sekelela. Aa sala ba tandili kunze, kale a kuga isi na nyina na bazigigwa bakwe no ku ngina u mu kalele u mwanuke. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Mi kale a mu kwatilila mu maganja no ku muta buti, “Talita koumi!” Intaluso “Mukazana, nasa ku lugwila buka!”<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Ao bulyo mukazana kale a buka no kutatika uku jenda, ukuti ka kwewsi imyaka jo ku zaligwa je kumi na jobile (12), mi kaba komokite lwini wawa. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Mi Jesu kale a bata buti, caki mu leke uku lugwila abantu ibi bi la tendaali, no kutyo mu muwe bilyo alye.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa kanigwa ku bakwakwe mwa Nazaleta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateu13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka4.16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Mi Jesu kale zwa momo mucilalanda no kuja ku cilalanda ca gwakwe, mi abazigigwa bakwe kale ba mu umpilila. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Ijuba lyo nsabata aa seli lasiki, kale atatika ukuziga mu Macinagoge, mi abantu bonse kaba mushugwa kale bakomokwa no kuta buti, “Kwibo naga bigwana joju unkosi bebi bintu? Butalinzi a kwesi ubu naa wegwa, mi mamakazonzi ga ga akwesi ukutenda?” <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Joju tali nomubeji? Ntali ni mwana Maliya mukulwe gwa Jemusi, Jose, Juda ne Simoni, bakwakwe tali neswe bakele? Mi kale bakana uku mu zumina.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Jesu kale abata buti, “Umuboni ala kutikigwa mu malonga ga kungi, kono kuba mwilonga lyakwe no kuba kwakwe taba mukutiki nabo mukoga gwakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Taa kagola ukutenda amamakazo momo, bwita ukutula bulyo amaganja gakwe abantu bace aba kaba lwala no kuba lwalukisa. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Mi naga komokwa lwini abantu muku bula kwabo intumelo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Jesu aa tuma abazigigwa bekumi na bobile</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateu10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka9.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Mi Jesu kale a zimumbuluka mu minzigana no minzi minene, naja buziga. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Jesu kale a kuga bekumi na bobile (12), no kuba tuma bobile ka bobile, no ku bawa inguzu egulu jo myoya imimangoju. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Kale abalaga buti, “Muleke kuinda cimwinya mu lujendo lwenu, bwita ulutaga, baleke ukuinda icinkwa kampa muzigo kampa masheleni mu mapokoto gabo. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Mu zwate inshangu mi muleke kuinda nanga mukanjo gonke.” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Kale aba gambaguza buti, “Mu njugo jonse iji na mungine, na mukalemo kusikila aa na muzwe momo mu munzi. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Mi ati bantu mwaceco icibaka taa naba mitambule no kukana kumishugwa, namu leke ceco cibaka no ku kunkumuna iluli lya ku matende genu, ubu na bube bumpaki bwenu kwabo kubu mangoju bwabo.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Kale baja buziga abantu buti babange. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Kale batanda imyoya mimangoju imingi, mi ubungi bo balwele, kale baba singa amafuta no ku lwaluka.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulufwu lwa Joani Mukolobezi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateu14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka9.7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Umfumu Eloda aa shugwa byebi byonse, buti izina lya Jesu kale lya zibaala lwini, bamwinya buti ka batyo, “Joani mukolobezi ala buki ku bafwu mpaa kutendaala ama makazo ga tendigwa ke nguzu jakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Bamwinya buti ka batyo, “Ni Eliya,” Kame bamwinya buti ka batyo, “Muboni, go kukoza sinagwe jumwinya go baboni bo kale.”<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Kono Eloda aa naga shugwa bobo, kale atyo buti, “Ni Joani u mukolobezi uju nana koshola umutwi, uju ala buki ku bafwu!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Ukuti Eloda neje naga tuma abantu buti ba kashumine Joani no ku mutula muntolongo, kebaka lyo kusesa muka mwanjegwe Filipi. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Joani naga gambaguza Eloda buti, “To botele kusesa muka mwancego.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Mu kutenda bobo, Elodiyasi kale amuzimba, noku kashaka buti Joani ayagigwe, kono kale akangwa, <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />ukuti Eloda ka jogite Joani, mu kuziba buti nu nkosi ka cenete no bugomba. Mi Eloda aa ka shugwanga Joani na tandaza, ka zikinyeanga lwini, ukuti ka shakanga uku mu tegelezanga.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ku mamaninino Elodiyasi kale a gwana kaito, mwijuba lyo mukiti go ku zaligwa gwe Mfumu Eloda, mi kale a memela a manduna ba kunkuta jakwe na bakulu bo masole no bantu bo butokwa ka bazwa mucilalanda ca Galileya. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mi mwana Elodiyasi go mukazana, kale a ngina noku nenga, mi kale a nyangulula Eloda na banyenda bakwe. Mi Umfumu kale atyo buti ku mukazana, “U ni kumbile icintu conse ici u shaka, mi kuti ni cikuwe.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Mi kale a mu kuluwiza buti, “Icintu conse ici saka ukumbile kuti ni kuwe, nanga kuku koshwela ku mubuso gwangu!” <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Mukazana kale aa ja no ka lugwila nyina buti, “Maa cinzi ni botele uku kumbila?” Nyina kale amu taba buti, “Ukumbile umutwi gwa Joani mukolobezi.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Mi ao bulyo mukazana kale abogola ku Mfumu no kumbila buti, “Nasa shaka buti aano u niwe bulyo umutwi gwa Joani akasuba!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Mi umfumu kale alinyaza lwini, kono kebaka lyo bintu naga kuluwiza no kulishumina na kele no banyenda, kale ga kangwa uku mu kanina. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Ao bulyo umfumu kale atuma jumwinya go bamameli bo ntolongo, buti aka koshole umutwi gwa Joani aka muletele. Umulindili kale akaja ku ntolongo no ka koshola umutwi gwa Joani, <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />no ka gu leta akasuba no kuwa umukazana, mi u mukazana kale agu tambika nyina. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Abazigigwa ba Joani aa naba shugwa byebyo nabya tendaala, kale ba keza kuinda icitupu cakwe no ka muzika mwibita.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu alela bantu abangi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:13-21">Maleka14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joani6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Abatumigwa kale bagwanana no kubunganina Jesu, no ku mugambaguza byonse ibi naba katenda no kuziga. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Mi kale atyo kwabo buti, “Mukeze tuje kumbali uku takuli abantu, ukuti tukawiseko kanini mi ubungi bo bantu kabakeza no kaja mi takabakwesi inako jokulya.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Mi kale ba longana mubwato kaja ukule ku cibaka ciombele.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Kono bungi bo bantu aba na baba bona naba kaja, kale baba ziba no kutiga no matende mu minzi jonse no kaba tantilila ku buso. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Jesu aa sala suki mubwato, mi kale abona abantu bangi, no kuba fwila inse, ukuti kaba kozite sinagwe ni ngu taji kwesi umulisani, mi kale ga tatika ku baziga ibintu bingi. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Mwa jejo inako ijuba ase lija butenguwa, abazigigwa kale bakeza kwa Jesu no kumuta buti, “Tula nangisi. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Mute abantu ba ngundumuke buti ba kaje ku minzi no ku bilalanda bya afuwi buti baka ligulile zo kulya.” <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Kono Jesu kale ge bataba buti, “Mu bawe byo kulya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Kale bamu taba buti, “Gwasa shaka buti tuinde amasheleni go muntu uju alabelekeli imyezi ja tosanwe na myezi jotatwe gonse tu gainde tuka ga gule byo kulya no kubawa buti balye?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Mi kale gaba buza buti, “Binkwa byoti mukwesi? Mi mujende muka bilole.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Ase bala ka shakisisi kale batyo, “Binkwa byo tosanwe ibi tukwesi ne nswi zobile.”<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Cwale Jesu kale aba lugwila buti ba kalike abantu bonse mu tugugi mubwiju bo lulemba. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Mi kale bakalika abankosi mutugugi to makumi ge kumi bamwinya mu makumi ga tosanwe. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Mi Jesu kale ainda amakwaela go binkwa ga tosanwe ne nswi zobile noku ligamina kwigulu, mi kale a kumbila noku komagula ibinkwa, mi kale abiwa kuba umpilili bakwe buti ba taangile abantu. Kame kale gaba taangila ne inswi mukati kabo bonse. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Bonse kale balya no ku kuta, <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />mi abazigigwa kale ba bumba ibitundu bye kumi na byobile byo bu bugulusi bo binkwa ne nswi. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Mi abankosi na balya ka bali bo myanda ja tosanwe (5,000).<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa jenda amenzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-23">Mateu14.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Joani6.15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Ao bulyo Jesu kale a lugwila abazigigwa bakwe buti bangine mubwato, buti ba litangize abuso kwakwe ku munzi gwa Betasaida, ige aa kasi gundumuna bantu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Aa sala baleki, kale a kaja kalija kwilundu ka kumbila. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Mwi nako jo lutengwana, ubwato akati ke ziba ka bu jendele, mi Jesu genke ka kela mwisilya lye kamba. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Kale ga bona bazigigwa naba zoganisa ukuzuga ubwato buti buje abuso, ukuti inkuli kame kaji balwisa lwini. Ao bulyo ijuba nalisini ukun’tula amasikusiku, kale ga bezila najenda amenzi mwi ziba. Seka shaka ku ba itilila, <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />mi aa bamu bona ajenda mwi ziba, kale ba gaja buti “Cilumba.” Kale bakumba lwini. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Ukuti bonse naba mubona mi naba joga wawa. Ao bulyo kale agamba kwabo buti, “Mube no bundume, nime! Muleke kujoga.” <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Mi kale angina mubwato umu kabali, mi inkuli kale ja ombelela. Mi naba komokwa wawa, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />ukuti shugwisisa umutendelo go binkwa, mi imyojo jabo kaji ku kutuwite.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu a oza abalwele mwa Genezaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mateu14.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Aa sebala lutili mwi silya ziba, kale baka fugika mucilalanda ca Genezaleti no ka shumininamo bwato. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Ao bulyo aa se bala longoki mubwato, abantu kale bamu ziba. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Mi kale batigatiga mwilonga lyonse kaleta balwele bonse ku batwala konse uku kaba shugwa buti kokwa gwanaala. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Mi konse uku kaita mu minzi na minzigana kampa mulugole, kaba letenga abalwele kuba tula ankanza, mi bantu kaba mu kumbila buti bakwate nanga ku mamaninino go mukanjo gwakwe, mi bonse aba naba kwatako naba lwaluka.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Muzigilo go bakulu katanzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Mateu15.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Abafalisi no bazigi bo mulao bamwinya aba ka bazwa kwa Jelusalema, bonse kale ba keza ku gwanana kwa Jesu, <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />mi kale ba bona bamwinya bo baumpilili bakwe na balya ibilyo ne tukuta ku maganja, uku taba lashambi.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Abafalisi no Majuda bonse tabali bilyo naba sini ku shamba ku maganja gabo, ko cizo bwita kushamba tansila ku maganja buti ba kwatilile icizo ca bakukulu katanzi. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Aa bazwa ku bibaka byo magulikizo taa ka balya bwita u kushamba tansila. Mi kaba mamela ibizo bingi, byo ku koza sinagwe ku sanza a makomosi, no tulongo no bitale.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Cwale Abafalisi no bazigi bo mulao kale ba buza Jesu, “Cinzi a bazigigwa bako aa taba joji kuja ko cizo co bakulu, kono ba salya ibilyo ne tukuta ku maganja?”<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Mi Jesu kale aba taba buti, “Isaya naa gamba wawa, inwe mwe muliwite, sinagwe ubu ku n’olelwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">‘Abantu baba basa ni kutika ko milomo jabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">Kono imyojo jabo kule ji kele neme.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Basa ni tongamina mu kubula intuso, ibi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">Baziga milao bulyo jo buntu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">Inzigo jabo milao jo buntu bulyo.’”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />“Na mwa tula imilao ja Nyambe ku mbali, no ku tongomana icizo co buntu.”<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Jesu kame kale a bata buti, “Mu lizi nenja ubu mukanila umulao gwa Nyambe buti mugongolekeze mu cizo cenu. <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Mi Mushe nagamba buti, ‘U kutike ba nyoko na besho,’ ‘Gense uju a fwija nyina kampa besi ali botele uku yagigwa.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Kono inwe Mafalisi no bazigi bo mulao mwa sata buti, “Ati umuntu nata banyina kampa besi buti, Intuso jonse mu botele ku tambula kwangu ni Kolobaleni, (Intaluso, ici ciwegwa kwa Nyambe), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Cwale taa na zuminize jojo kutusa cimwinya ku banyina kampa ku besi. <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Mwa zezo, kame mujonagula ijwi lya Nyambe kebaka lyo cizo cenu ici muziga abantu. Mi kobili bimwinya ibi mu umpilila byo ku likoza na byebi.”<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ibintu ibi tabi cenisi umuntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Mateu15.10-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Kame Jesu kale a kuga abantu bonse ko bantu kwakwe no kubata buti, “Muni tegeleze mwense, mi muni shugwisise. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Takuli conse ici cizwa kunze cingina mu mubili go muntu ici ci mujona, kono ici ci zwa mukati kakwe ceco ci mukangwisa uku cena.” <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />Ukuti umuntu uju akwesi amatwi, ashugwe.<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Jesu aa salaleki a bantu, kale angina munjugo, mi abazigigwa bakwe kale ba mubuza bya jejo inguli. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Mi Jesu kale aba buza buti, “Nenwe kame tamuzumini,” “Tamuwene buti takuli icintu ca kunze ci ngina ku muntu ici ci mujona? <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Ukuti ta cingini mu mojo gwakwe kono mu mwivumo lyakwe, no kuzwila kunze jo mubili.” (Mu kugamba bobo, Jesu kale atyo, ibilyo byonse bya kucena.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Kame kale atyo, “Ici ci zwa mu muntu ceco ci mujona. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Ukuti mukati ko mojo go muntu umu kuzwilila imigajalo mi mangoju, cise, ibi tabikwesi ikute, migajalo mimangoju, ubu yagi, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />kulala no muka muntu, muna, ntalu, manya, kusebeka, buomi, bushanshu no kubula inse. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Byebi byonse bimangoju, mu mojo go muntu bizwa no kuletela umuntu kusa cena.”<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intumelo jo mwanakazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mateu15.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Jesu kale azwa momo mu cibaka, mukati ke cilalanda ca Tile na Sidoni. Kale angina munjugo mi taa kashaka buti a zibigwe nanga ku muntu genke, mi kale a kangwa u kulizinda muku zibigwa. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Ao bulyo, umwanakazi uju ka kwesi mwane go mukazana uju ka kwesi umoya umu mangoju aa shugwa Jesu, kale akeza ku tongama ku matende ga Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Jojo Mwanakazi kali Mugelike, uju naga zaligwa mwa Siliya Foenisiya. Kale a kumbila Jesu buti a tande mayauma kwa mwane go mukazana. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Jesu kale a muta buti, “Uleke tansila a banuke balye byonse ibi ba shaka, taku botele ukutapa a banuke cinkwa no ku ci showela bambwa.”<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Umwanakazi kale taba buti, “Mfumwangu, nanga bambwa bali mwisiko lye ntafule ba kulya bubugulusi bugwa ku banuke.”<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Jesu kale a mutaba buti, “Kebaka lyo mutabilo gogu, ula gola kukaja, a mayauma galazwi kwa mwano.”<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Mi aa kasika ku njugo, kale akagwana mwane mayauma gala muleki, mi mwane pabulo kalele.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa oza unkosi gwe ciuumu no buulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Mi Jesu kale a zwa mukati ke cilalanda ca Tile no kuitila mwa Sidoni, no ku sezumukila kwi ziba lya Galileya buitile mukati ke longa Dekapolisi. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Momo abantu kale ba muletela unkosi uju taa kashugwa ne ciuumu, mi kale ba kumbila Jesu buti a mukwate. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Mi Jesu kale a mutwala kumbali kule ne bantu, Jesu kale anginika iminwe jakwe mu matwi go nkosi. Mi kale a tula amate ku munwe no ku kwata alulimi lwa jojo unkosi. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Kale a ligamina kwigulu no ku esumuka no kutyo kwakwe, “Efifata” (intaluso “Fwulumuka”).<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Ao bulyo a matwi gakwe kale ga galuka mi no lulimi lwakwe kale lwa tatika uku gamba nenja. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Jesu kale aba kanisa buti ba leke ku gambaguza nanga muntu genke. Kono kale ba zundamina uku gambaguza a bantu ibi naa tenda. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Mi abantu kale ba sisumuka no ku komokwa lwini. Kale bata buti, “Ibintu byonse naga bitenda nenja, mane naga letisa buti abaulu ba shugwe, aba ta bagambi bagambe.”<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa lela abantu bo myanda jone</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mateu15.32-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Mwa gago majuba, kagugi kamwinya ko bantu bangi kale kagwanana antuonke. Mi taa ka bakwesi byo kulya, Jesu kale a kuga abazigigwa bakwe no ku bata buti, <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“nasa fwila inse baba bantu, se bekele neme majuba gotatwe, mi taba kwesi co kulya. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Ati na ni ba bogoza ku minzi jabo naba fwite injala, mi bamwinya kuti baletukile mu nzila, ukuti bamwinya kule bazwa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Abazigigwa bakwe kale ba mutaba buti, “Kono mo muno tukele mu mangusu, uku saka bizwe ibinkwa saka tuwe bantu kwibo?” <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Jesu kale aba buza buti, “Binkwa byoti mukwesi?” Kale ba mutaba buti, “Byo tosanwe na byobile (7).”<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Kale a lugwila bantu buti be kale ansi. Aa sala indi ibinkwa bya tosanwe na byobile (7), noku kumbila kwa Nyambe, mi kale ga bitaa, noku bitaangila bazigigwa bakwe buti baka taangile bantu, mi kale batenda bobo. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Kame ka bakwesi inswi ince inunu, kame kale a kumbila kwa Nyambe noku lugwila bazigigwa bakwe buti ba taangile bantu. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Abantu na balya noku kuikuta. Mi abazigigwa kale ba tola tola ubu bugulusi bo binkwa ubu nabwa sigala, ubu nabwa bumba ibitundu bya tosanwe na byobile (7). <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Abantu kebekeleo ka bali bo bikiti byone (4,000). Jesu aa sala aba gundumuni, <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Jesu kale a longana mubwato na bazigigwa bakwe, no kaja ku cilalanda ca Dalimanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafalisi aa ba kumbila Imakazo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mateu12.38-42</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">16.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Bafalisi kale bakeza no keza kubuza Jesu mu ku mujeleka buti aba tendele imakazo jizwa kwigulu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Jesu kale a esumuka lwini no kutyo, “Kanti cinzi bantu ba shunuano aa ba kumbila imponiso? Ni conse nasa mi lugwila, takuli imponiso naji bonisigwe kwabo.”<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Mi kale aba leka, noku bogola ka longama mubwato noku lutila mwi silya lye ziba.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umumena go Bafalisi ne Eloda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Mateu16.5-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Abazigigwa naba zibala uku inda ibinkwa, bwita cinkwa conke bulyo ici kaba kwesi mubwato. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Jesu kale aba nanguza, “Mu manyuke, muzwe ku mumena gwa Bafalisi nagwa Eloda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Kale ba ligambaguza mwacabo buti, “Ta tukwesi ibinkwa.”<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Mu kuziba ibi ka bagambagula, Jesu kale aba buza buti, Cinzi aa mugambagula byo ku bula ibinkwa? Musini uku bona noku shugwilisa? Myojo jenu mikukutu? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />“Muli kwesi amensho kono tamu boni, muli kwesi amatwi kono tamu shugwi? Mi kame ta mugaji. <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Aa nana komagula ibinkwa byo tosanwe kutaangila abantu bobikiti bya tosanwe, bitundu byoti byo bubugulusi ibi namwa tola?” Kale ba mutaba buti, “Byekumi na byobile.”<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />“Mi aa nana komagula ibinkwa bya tosanwe na byobile byo bantu bo bikiti byone.” “Bitundu byoti byo bubugulusi ibi namwa tola?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Kale be taba buti, “Bya tosanwe na byobile.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Mi Jesu kale abata buti, “Na shunuano tamu shugwisisi?”<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aa oza unkosi gwe ciofu mu munzi gwa Betisaida</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Kale baja kwa Betisaida, mi abantu kale baka leta unkosi go ciofu, noku kumbila Jesu buti a mukwate. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Jesu kale ainda unkosi go ciofu bu mukwatilile kwi ganja noku mutwala kunze lyo munzi. Aa sala suwili mate mu mensho go nkosi, noku mukwata, Jesu kale atyo, “Kocili ici uwenee?” <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Unkosi kale aligamina kwigulu, “Niliwena bantu, basa bonaala sinagwe bishamu bizimbuluka bujenda.”<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Jesu kame kale atula amaganja gakwe mu mensho go nkosi. Mi amensho gakwe kale ga tonda, no kutatika uku bona, mi kale abona bintu byonse nenja. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Jesu kale amuta buti, kaje ku njugo jako, no kutyo kwakwe, “Uleke ka ngina mu munzi.”<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pitolosi aa paka Jesu buti ni Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13">Mateu16.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-1:0">Luka9.18–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Jesu na bazigigwa bakwe kale baja ku minzi kaji zimbulukite Sisaleya gwa Filipi. Munzila kale ababuza buti, “Abantu buti batyo, ni meni?”<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Kale ba mutaba buti, “Bamwinya nabo ni Joani mukolobezi, bamwinya nabo nime Eliya, kame bamwinya ka batyo uli jumwinya go baboni.”<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Jesu kale ababuza buti, “Kono ingenwe buti mutyo Nime ni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">Pitolosi kale a taba buti, “Nigwe Mesiya.”<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Jesu kale abananguza buti, “Baleke uku gambaguza umuntu nanga genke byakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa gamba byo kupenga kwakwe no lufwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Mateu16.21-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka9.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Jesu kale atatika kuziga abazigigwa bakwe buti, “Mwana Muntu ali botele kupengisigwa mu bintu bingi, noku kanigwa ku bakulu, noku bapulisita bakulu no bazigi bo mulao, mane alijelele kuyagigwa mi mwishule lyo majuba gotatwe kuti na buke ku bafwu. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Kale aba gambaguza jejo intaba nenja wawa takuli kuba zindila, mi Pitolosi kale atwala Jesu kumbali no katatika ku kajukukila. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Kono Jesu aa naa litemuna no kulola abazigigwa bakwe, kale ajukukila Pitolosi buti, “Zwa mwishule lyangu Satani!’ “Ukuti imigajalo jako tali migajalo ja Nyambe, kono migajalo bulyo jo buntu.”<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Mi Jesu kale akuga bantu antuonke na bazigigwa bakwe no kuta buti, “Muntu gense uju ashaka ukuni umpilila, bwita buti ali tobohe, mi ainde icifapano cakwe noku ni umpilila.” <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Kono gense uju ashaka kujojisa ubumi bwakwe, kuti nabu jonaukilwe, kono gense uju a jonaukilwa ubumi bwakwe kebaka lyo majwi gangu malotu, kuti na jojesigwe. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Bulotunzi buti, jumwinya muntu amune ilonga lyonse, kono na jonaukilwa ubumi bwakwe? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Umuntu cinzi a botele ukuwa ici ciita bumi bwakwe? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ati muntu gense uju na ni fwile inshoni ime no majwi gangu, mu luasi lwa shunwano lo matanya no bantu bamangoju, Mwana Muntu naje kuti na mu fwile inshoni, aa na keze no mang’iloi go kucena mu mukubega kwetuba kwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Jesu kale a bata buti, “Ni conse nasa milugwila, bamwinya aba bazimene aano taa naba bone ulufwu, uku na basini uku bona u Mubuso gwa Nyambe nagu keza ne nguzu.<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa bega kukoza tuba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mateu17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka9.28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Mwishule lyo majuba ga tosanwe ne kakole, Jesu kale a inda Pitolosi na Jamusi ne Joani, kale a kaja nabo kwilundu ile, uku naba kekala bonke. Mi kale azoka naba mulolele. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Ibizwato byakwe kale bya bega kuba byo kutuba lwini, takuli umusanzi mwilonga uju agola uku sanza ku tubisa kuita ao. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Kale kwa bonaala kwabo Eliya na Mushe, naba gambagula na Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Pitolosi kale atyo kwa Jesu, ‘Muzigi, bulotu kwetu aa twiikala kukuno. Ndokwenu tu jake ibikutu byo tatwe, cimwinya cako, cimwinya ca Mushe mi cimwinya ca Eliya.” <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Jesu kale a bula icigambo, mi kaba jogite lwini.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Mi ijoba kale lya bonaala kwabo noku bavwika, ijwi kale la shugwala mwi joba, ‘Joju ni Mwanangu uju ni shaka, mu mushugwe!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Ao bulyo aa balogolosa, takuli uju naba bona uju kakele nabo bwita Jesu bulyo.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Aa kaba sezumuka kuzwa kwilundu, Jesu kale abalaga buti, “Muleke kulugwila umuntu nanga genke ibi mula boni, bwita Mwana Muntu aa sala buki ku bafwu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Abazigigwa kale ba libikila gago majwi naba ligambaguza mwacabo buti, kubuka ku bafwu cinzi kutalusa?” <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Mi kale ba mubuza buti, “Cinzi abazigi bo mulao aa bata buti ni Eliya ajelele keza tanzi?”<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Mi Jesu kale gabata buti, “Za wawa Eliya, nege ajelele ukeza tanzi, no kulukisa ibintu byonse. Cwale cinzi kame aa kun’oletwe buti, Mwana Muntu alijelele ukupenga wawa noku kanigwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Kono nasa mi lugwila buti, Eliya salizite mi naba mutenda bonse ubu ka bashakila, sinagwe ubu kun’olelwe kebaka lyakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aoza unkosi uju akwesi moya mumangoju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-20">Mateu17.14-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka9.37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Aa bakeza ku bazigigwa bamwinya, kale ba bona naba zimbulukitwe ku bantu bangi, no bazigi bo mulao na baba kananisa. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Bwangu bwangu abantu aa babona Jesu kale bakomoka lwini noku mutigilila noka muzuminiza. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Cwale kale abuza buti, “Cinzi ici mukanana nabo?”<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Unkosi kali mukati ko bantu kale a taba buti, “Muzigi, ni mwanangu go muninzana ni laleti, uju akatazigwa ku moya mumangoju kame tagoli ukugamba. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Inako jonse aa gumu gwananga gula kumu gwisikizanga ansi, mi kuti a tundane noku tufula ifulo ku kanwa, noku kwenga meno noku golomena mubili gonse. Nila kumbili abazigigwa bako buti batande gogu moya mumangoju, kono bala gukangwi.<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Jesu kale abata buti, “Inwe mwe bantu tamuzumini mujoja mwa gaga majuba, mwinako ji sika kwibo nani kale nenwe? Kame majuba goti aga nani kale nenwe buti muni zumine? Mu mulete kwangu jojo muloba” <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Mi kale ba muleta. Ao umoya umubi aa segula boni Jesu kale gwa zungisa jojo muloba, mi kale a gwila aansi no kuli vunga vunga na kwesi kutufula efulo ku kanwa. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Jesu kale abuza besi bo muloba buti, “Mwi nako ji sika kwibo naca mutatika joju muloba?” Kale amu taba buti, “Kuzwa ku bwanuke bwakwe.” <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />‘Mi Inako jonse umoya mumangoju gula kumu gwisikizanga mu mulilo ne mu menzi nagu shaka uku muyaga. Ati ulagola kutenda cimwinya, utu shugwile nkumbu noku tutusa.’<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Jesu kale ata buti, ‘Ati ula gola, ibintu byonse bila golaala ku muntu uju azumina.”<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Ao bulyo isi go mwanuke kale a kugiliza buti, “Nila zumina, uni tuse nimanise uku sa zumina kwangu!”<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Mi Jesu aa bona ubungi bo bantu bonse bakeza bubutuka kwakwe, kale a jukukila umoya mumangoju muku gongolekeza natyo kwago buti, “Umoya gwe cuumu nogo buulu, kame ni kujukukila buti uzwe kwakwe, mi uleke kame uku bogola kungina kwakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Cwale umoya kale gwazwa ku muloba nagu kumbagana mwijwi nene noku ukutisa muninzana mu bushanshu, mi kale a sigala sinagwe muntu afwite, mi abantu bangi kabatyo buti, “Alafwi.” <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Kono Jesu kale akwata muloba kwiganja noku muzimika, mi kale a zimana.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Jesu aa sala ngini munjugo, bazigigwa bakwe kale ba mubuza kumbali buti, “Iswe cinzi aa tatula tandi umoya?”<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Mi Jesu kale aba taba buti, “Ni ntapelo bulyo ji gola uku tanda umoya go mufuta gogu, takuli cimwinya kame.”<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa gamba kame byo lufwu lwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mateu17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka9.43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Jesu no bazigigwa bakwe kale bazwa mwa ceco cibaka noku kuitila mwa Galileya. Kono Jesu taa kashaka buti nanga muntu genke azibe uku kabekele, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />ukuti kakwesi kuziganga abazigigwa bakwe buti, “Mwana Muntu kuti na legezwe ku wegwa mu maganja go bantu, mi kuti naba muyage. Amajuba gotatwe aa sega laiti kame kuti na buke ku bumi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Kono bazigigwa taa naba shugwisisa ibika talusa, mi kale bajoga uku mubuza.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umunene nini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateu18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka9.46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Kale basika mu munzi gwa Kapenauma, Jesu aakali munjugo, Jesu kale abuza bazigigwa buti, “Cinzi ka mukanana mu nzila?”<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Kono kale ba ombelela bulyo ukuti munzila kaba kanana buti umunene nini. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Jesu kale akala ansi, mi kale akuga abazigigwa bekumi na bobile, mi kale atyo kwabo buti, “Umuntu gense uju ashaka ukuba gwe ntanzi, ali botele kuba go mamaninino ku bamwinya, kame abe muika gwa bamwinya bonse.” <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Mi kale ainda mwanukegana uju naga tula mukati kabo, kale amunanuna noku tyo kwabo, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />“Gense uju tambule jumwinya go banukegana mwizina lyangu, nime ala tambuli, mi gense uju ani tambula tala tambulime kono jojo uju naa tumi.”<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Gense uju tatulwisi niswe azimanina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luka9.49-50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Joani kale atyo kwakwe buti, “Muzigi, tula boni umuntu uju akatanda mayauma mwizina lyako, mi tula mubindi, ukuti taa kali jumwinya gwetu.”<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Jesu kale atyo buti, “Muleke uku mubinda, ukuti takuli muntu uju a tenda imakazo mwizina lyangu uju saka gambe cigambo cimangoju kwangu. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Mi gense uju tatulwisi kwetu akele. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Zawawa nasa milugwila buti, gense uju amiwa amenzi mu nkomosi mwizina lyangu, ukuti muli ba Kilesite, ni conse nasa mi lugwila taa naba jonaukilwe umupozo gwabo.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umujeleko gwe Cibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mateu18.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka17.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Ati umuntu jumwinya naletela jumwinya gwa baba banukegana aba bazumina kwangu uku sitagala, icilotu kwakwe caku mushunmina ibwe nene munsingo noku mushowela mwi wate. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Ati iganja lyako nali kuletela uku sitagala, uli koshole. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />Mi ubulotu kangina mu bumi ne ganja lyonke kuita kuba no maganja gobile aga gaku twala mwi leba, umulilo ugu tagu zimi. <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Mi itende lyako aa likuletela bumangoju uli koshole. Icilotu kwako ka ngina mu bumi noli cilema, sini kuba no matende gobile noka showelwa mwi leba. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />Mi ubulotu kangina mu bumi ne ganja lyonke kuita kuba no maganja gobile aga gaku twala mwi leba, umulilo ugu tagu zimi. <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Mi ati ilinsho lyako nali kusitagalisa, uli nonkolemo Icilotu kwako ku ngina mu mubuso gwa Nyambe ne linsho lyonke sini kuba no mensho gobile noku showelwa mwi leba. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Mi ubulotu kangina mu bumi ne ganja lyonke kuita kuba no maganja gobile aga gaku twala mwi leba, umulilo ugu tagu zimi.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Sinagwe ubu kulungilwa izwai mu busunso, no umuntu gense kuti na lungigwe kezwai lyo mulilo.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Izwai nilotu, kono ati na lilasampuki, buti kame ugola uku lizolela izwai?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">Mube no zwai lyo busele mukati kenu, mi mujoje mu nkozo na bamwinya.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa ziga byo kulilukulula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mateu19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Jesu kale azwa momo mu cibaka no kuja mucilalanda ca Judeya no kaluta iziba lya Jodani. Mi ubungi bo bantu kale ba keza kwakwe, mi kokuja ubu katendelanga, kale aba ziga.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Abafalisi kale ba keza kujeleka Jesu muku mubuza buti, Umukwame, “Alijelele uku lukulula umukazi gwakwe?”<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Jesu kale abe taba buti, “Cinzi naa milaga Mushe?”<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Kale batyo buti, “Mushe naga zuminiza umukwame kun’ola in’olo lyo ku lukulula umukazi noku mutanda.”<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Jesu kale abata buti, “Mushe aa naga n’ola gogu umulao, ni baka lyo bukababu bo myojo jenu.” <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Kono ku matatikilo go kubumba ilonga, Nyambe naga bumba mukwame no mukazi. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />Mi kaleli ibaka, umukwame kuti naleke banyina no besi, noka gunzamina ku mukazi gwakwe, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />mi ububeli bwabo kuti na babe umubili gonke. Mi cwale taa na babe bobile kono mubili gonke bulyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Mi Nyambe ici naa ngungika antuonke, takuli uju ajelele ukucitaa.”<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Aa see kabali munjugo, bazigigwa kame kale ba buza Jesu jejo intaba. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Kale abata buti, “Muntu gense uju alukulula mukazi gwakwe no kusesa mwanakazi jungi alatendi cise kwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Mi umukazi naje aa kana mukwame gwakwe no kasesigwa ku nkosi jungi alatendi cise.”<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imfwijaguzi ja Jesu ku banukegana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateu19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka18.15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Abantu kame kaba leta banukegana kwa Jesu buti aba tule amaganja gakwe abo, kono bazigigwa kale bajukukila aba kababa leta. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Jesu aa sala boni bobo, kale anyegela no kutyo kwabo buti, “Muleke banukegana bakeze kwangu, mi muleke uku bakanisa, ukuti Mubuso gwa Nyambe gwa babo bokukoza sinagwe banukegana. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Zawawa nasa milugwila, umuntu gense uju taa na tambule Mubuso gwa Nyambe sinagwe joju mwanukegana taa nagu ngine.” <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Jesu kale aba inda mu maganja gakwe no ku bakwata no kuba mfwijagula.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Unkosi go lubono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateu19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka18.18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Jesu aa sala tatiki ulujendo lwakwe, unkosi kale ga mutigilila no keza kugwila abuso ku matende gakwe. Kale ga mubuza buti, “Muzigi umulotu, cinzi ni jelele uku tenda buti nani kajobole ubumi tabumani?”<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Jesu kale amutaba buti, “Cinzi aa uni kuga mulotu? Takuli mulotu bwita Nyambe genke bulyo. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Ulizekelele imilao ji tyo, ‘Uleke kwiyaga, uleke cise, uleke kuiba, uleke kupaka zomanya, uleke kuinda ca jumwinya kobuomi, uleke kujonena umuntu mi ukutike nyoko nesho.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Mi ige kale amutaba buti, “Muzigi, zonse zezi nana zimamela kuzwa ku bwanuke bwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Jesu kale amu logolosa ko cisemo, mi kale atyo kwakwe buti, “Cintu conke tokwesi, ujende uka gulise ibi ukwesi byonse no kuwa abampale, mi kuti nogwane ulubono lwa kwigulu. Keza uni umpilile.” <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Unkosi aa sala shugwi bobo, kale akaja bufwite ishoni, ukuti kakwesi ulubono lungi.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Jesu kale alogolosa noku tyo ku bazigigwa bakwe, “Bukababu buti uju akwesi ulubono na kangina mu Mubuso gwa Nyambe!”<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Bazigigwa kale ba komokwa lwini ko majwi gakwe. Kame Jesu kale anungako buti, “Banangu, bukukutu buti uku ngina mu Mubuso gwa Nyambe! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Icilotu ca kamele ku ngina mulinsho lye nsonga, isini uju akwesi lubono a ngine mu mubuso gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Bazigigwa kale bakomokwa lwini wawa, noku ligambaguza mwacabo, “Cwale nini agola uku jojesigwa?”<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Jesu kale abalolela no kutyo, “Ku muntu ceci cikababu, kono kwa Nyambe, ibintu byonse bitole kwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Cwale Pitolosi kale agamba buti, “Tula sigi ibintu byonse noku kuumplila.”<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Jesu kale etaba buti, “Ni conse nasa mi lugwila buti, takuli muntu uju naa leka injugo, nciijakwe, banyina kampa besi kampa bane kampa ulugwa lwangu no majwi gangu, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />takuli nanga genke kwabo uju saka kangwe uku tambula ibintu bingi wawa mwi nako jeji, majungo, baloba no bakazana, bamaa, banuke no lugwa, mane noku shuminigwa, mwi nako jikeza jo bumi tabumani. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Mi aba bakele kubuso kuti na babe mwishule, bamwishule kuti nababe kubuso.”<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa gamba lyatatu kazo lufwu lwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateu20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka18.31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Ao kabali mulujendo lo kuja kwa Jelusalema. Jesu nije kali tangize abuso mi abazigigwa bakwe mi kaba komokite. Kono babo kaba mu umpilile kabajogite. Kame Jesu kale abogola kumbali nabe kumi kabobile no kubata ibi saka bitendaale kwakwe. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Jesu kale abata buti, “Kwa Jelusalema tuja, koko Mwana Muntu kuti awegwe mu maganja go mupulisita munene no ku bazigi bo mulao. Uku saka baka mwatwiile ulufwu no ku muwa mu maganja go bantu, <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />aba naba mushengule no ku musuwagila mate, kumu cwapagula noku muyaga. Kono mwishule lyo majuba go tatwe kuti na buke.”<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kulikumbilila kwa Jemusi na Joani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mateu20.20-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Cwale Jemusi na Joani, bana Zebedea, kale bakeza kwa Jesu, noku muta buti, “Muzigi, tusashaka buti utu tendele ibi saka tukumbile byonse.”<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Jesu kale aba buza buti, “Cinzi mushaka buti nimi tendele?”<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Kale ba mutaba buti, “Utuzuminine buti aa no kale mukanya jako, natu kukale jumwina ku mulyo jumwinya ku monsho.”<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Jesu kale atyo buti, “Tamwizi ibi mukumbila, mula gola kunywa mu nkomosi jo mapenzi ni nywina kampa ku kolobezwa inkolobezo nana kolobezigwa kajo?”<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Kale bamutaba buti, “Tula gola,” Jesu kale abatyo buti, “Kuti munywine cwale munkomosi iji ni jelele kunywina noku kolobezigwa iji ni jelele uku kolobezigwa kajo. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Kono tani kwesi nguzu jo kushalula uju na kakale ku mulyo kampa kumonsho. Ni Nyambe uju nawe byebi ibibaka kwababo naga lukiseza.”<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Bekumi aa sebala shugwi bobo, kale banyegelela Jemusi na Joani. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Jesu kale aba kuga bonse noku bata buti, “Muli zekelele buti babo aba bategwa buti mbo bajendesi bo macaba no mfumu egulu lyabo, mi abakulu basa jendesa ko nguzu jabo. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Mi takukele bobo nokwenu, gense uju ashaka ukuba munene akati kenu ali jelele kuba muika gwenu, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />mi gense uju ashaka ukuba gwe tanzi ali jelele kuba muika gwenu mwense. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Ici naga kezila Mwana Muntu tali buti asebelezwe, kono cakuta buti abelekele abantu, mi abawe ubumi bwakwe, buti awe ubumi bwakwe buti abantu bajojeswe kakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aoza ciofu Batimeya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateu20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka18.35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Aa sebala siki mwa Jeliko, Jesu na bazigigwa bakwe, antuonke ne kagugi ko bantu bangi aa kabazwa mu munzi, unkosi go ciofu gwe zina lya Betameya (intaluso, mwana Timeyasi) uju kekele ambali ne nzila nakumbila. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Aa shugwa buti ni Jesu gwa Nazaleta, kale atatika ku kugiliza buti, “Jesu igwe Mwana Daviti, unifwile nkumbu!”<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Bamwinya kale bamulwisa buti ombelele. Kono kale akugiliza wawa buti, “Igwe Mwana Daviti, unifwile nkumbu!”<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Jesu kale azimana nokutyo, “Mu mukuge.” Kale bakuga iciofu, uligongoze! “Zimana ko matende gako! Kame akukuga.”<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Batimeya kale ashowa umukanjo gwakwe kumbali, kale ashotokela mwigulu no kuja kwa Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Jesu kale amu buza buti, “Cinzi ushaka buti niku tendele?” Mi unkosi gwe ciofu kale etaba buti, “Muzigi, kubona nishaka!”<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Jesu kale amuta buti, “Ujende, intumelo jako jila kulwalukisi.” Ao bulyo kale atambula ukubona noku umpilila Jesu munzila.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu angina ko Bumfumu mwa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateu21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joani12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Jesu na bazigigwa bakwe aa sekaba kokelele kwa Jelusalema, afuwi no minzi ja Betefage na Betenia, kwilundu lya Olive. Jesu kale atuma bazigigwa bakwe bobile, <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />kale atyo kwabo buti, “Mukaje mu munzi ugu guli abuso bwenu, aa mungimo bulyo, kuti mugwane akambongolo aka kasungitwe, aka kasini kutendigwa impeleswa ku muntu, mi muka kashumunune mi mukalete kukuno. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Muntu uju saka amibuze buti, “Cinzi mutenda bobo’ mu mutabe buti, Umfumu kame akashaka mi wangu wangu kuti ka kabogoze.”<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Bazigigwa kale bakaja no kagwana akambongolo aka kasungilwe acinzi colapa. Aa sebala kashumununi, <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />abantu kaba zimeneo kale bababuza buti, “Cinzi mutenda, aa mushumununa kako kambongolo?”<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Kale betaba kuja kobu naa batela Jesu, mi kale ba baleka buti bajende. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Kale baleta aka mbongolo kwa Jesu, no kujala imikanjo jabo akambongolo, mi Jesu noku kalija. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Ubungi bo bantu kale bajala imikanjo jabo munzila, bamwinya kame kale batema mavuna gamulugwa lwabo noku jala munzila. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Mi abantu aba kabajenda kubuso naba kaba baumpilile kale ba kugiliza buti, “Osana! Imfwijaguzi jajojo akeza mwi zina lyo Mfumu!” <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Imfwijaguzi ja mubuso gu keza gwe setu Deviti! Osana mu bule bwa kwigulu!”<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Jesu kale angina mwa Jelusalema, mi kale angina mwilapa lyo Tempele. Mi kale alogolosa ibintu byonse, mi sekakuli lutengwana, kale aja kwa Beteniya na bekumi ka bobile.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu afwija cishamu co Bukuju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18-19">Mateu21.18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Ijuba nalya nungako, aa kaba kabogola kuzwa kwa Beteniya, Jesu kafwite injala. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Kale abona icishamu co Bukuju kulegana ici ka cikwesi amani, mi kale aaja kabona bunga kuti aka gwaneko ibiyango. Kono aa sala kasiki ku cishamu ceco, kale agwana buti takuli biyango bwita mani, ukuti tali nako jo kuaka ibiyango. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Jesu kale atyo ku cishamu buti, “Kame nakuleke nanga muntu genke kulya ciyango kwako!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Mi bazigigwa kale ba mushugwa nagamba.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa tanda abantu mwilapa lyo Tempele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateu21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Joani2.13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Mi aa sala siki mwa Jelusalema, Jesu kale angina mwilapa lye tempele, noku tatika uku tanda bonse aba kaba gulisa no kugula momo. Mi kale agalumuna amatafule go bantu kaba cinca masheleni no tubuloko twababo kaba gulisa utunkwilimba, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />mi taa kazuminiza umuntu gense aindite cimwinya mwilapa lye tempele. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Jesu kale aziga abantu buti, “Taku n’oletwe buti mu man’olo, ‘Injugo jangu kuti naji kugigwe injugo jo makumbililo jo malonga gonse.’ Kono namwa zola injugo jangu amalibiko go basa!”<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Bapulisita bakulu no bazigi bo mulao, aa bashugwa bobo, mi kale bashaka kaito ko kumuyaga, kaba mujogete, ukuti abantu bonse kaba komokite ibi kaziga.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Aa sekula tenguwi, Jesu na bazigigwa bakwe kale bazwa mu munzi.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intaluso jo cishamu co bukuju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Mateu21.20-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Aa nabwaca masikusiku, aa kaba kwesi ukujenda mu nzila, kale babona icishamu co bukuju buti cila jumi miisi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Pitolosi kale akaja kalugwila Jesu buti, “Muzigi, uliwene! Icishamu co bukuju ici nagwa mfwija naca juma!”<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Jesu kale abetaba buti, “Mube ne ntumelo kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Zawawa nasa milugwila buti, ati umuntu jumwinya na lugwila leli ilundu buti, “Kaje, ukaligwisikize mwiwate,’ noku satongauka mu mojo gwakwe, kono na zumina buti ici agamba kuti citendaale, kuti aci tendelwe. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Mi nasa nimilugwila buti, icintu conse ici saka ukumbile nko ntapelo, muzumine buti mula citambuli, mi kuti nacibe cako. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Mi aa muzimana na mulapela, ati muli kwesi intaba no muntu jumwinya, umukwatile, mi ne Tata gwa kwigulu kuti aku kwatile ubumangoju bwako.” <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />Kono aa tokwatili, ne Tata gwa kwigulu taa na kukwatile ubumangoju bwako.”<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa buzigwa zo nguzu jakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateu21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka20.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Kame kale babogola kwa Jelusalema, Jesu aa sika mwilapa lyo tempele abapulisita bakulu no bazigi bo mulao ne bakulu, kale bakeza kwakwe, <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />noku mubuza buti, “Mwi nguzunzi umutenda zezi zintu zonse? Mi nini alakuwi inguzu jo kutenda zezi?”<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Jesu kale ataba buti, “Kuti ni mi buze impuzo jonke. Muni tabe, mi kuti ni migambaguze inguzu iji nili tutisa mukutenda zezi zintu. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Jesu kale ataba buti, “Inkolobezo ja Joani kwigulu kajizwa kampa ku bantu? Munilugwile!<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Kale ba ligambaguza mwacabo buti, “Ati na tugamba buti, ‘Kwigulu jizwa,’ kuti atubuze buti, ‘Cwale cinzi aa taa namwazumina Joani?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Kono ati natugamba buti, ‘Kubantu jizwa,’” (Kame kaba jogete abantu, ukuti muntu gense naga zumina buti Joani kali muboni.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Cwale kale betaba Jesu buti, “Ta tuzekelele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Jesu kale atyo buti, “Nanga saka nimi gambanguze buti mu nguzunzi nitenda zezi zintu, tamushugwilisi.”<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Inguli jo mulimi gwa Veine</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateu21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka20.9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Jesu kale atatika kugamba kwabo mu manguli buti, “Unkosi sali kubyala ibishamu byo Veine mwigwa lyakwe, mi kale alitula mulubaga no kusa ici ndanda co kudukwila iveine no kujaka ulutala. Mi kale akalimisa igwa lyakwe ku balimi ije no kuja ku cibaka cingi. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Inako jo kuzimbula aa sejila siki, kale atuma muika buti akaindeko lukau lwakwe ulu nawegwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Mi kale bamukwata no ku mukaba no kumubogoza icikwasha maganja. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Kale atuma ko mwika jumwinya kwabo mi kale batenda ibikelela ku mutwi no ku mutenda ubumangoju. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Kale atuma kame jumwinya, mi jojo kale ba kamwiyaga. Kale atuma ko bamwinya bangi, bamwinya kale baka kabigwa ba mwinya no kayagigwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Mi kasisigalize umwana genke go muloba go kutuma, uju kashaka. Ku mamaninino kale amutuma, no kutyo, ‘Kuti bakawe kute Mwanangu.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />“Kono abalindi kale baligambaguza mwacabo buti, “Uju no musele, mukeze tumuyage mi niswe natujobole ulugwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Cwale kale ba mukwata noku muyaga noku mushowela kunze lyegwa lyo veine.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />“Cwale umwinigwa cinzi ajelele ukutenda?” Mi kuti na keze kwiyaga babo abalindi, igwa no kuliwa bangi. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Ukuti taa na mwabala in’olo lityo, Icianda naca kanigwa kubajaki, ceco naca zoka kuba icianda co butokwa, <verse eid="MRK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />nu Mfumu naa tenda bobo, mi ceci cilotu mu mensho getu!”<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Mi abapulisiti bakulu, no bazigi bo mulao no bakulu kale bashaka akaito ko ku kwata Jesu, ukuti kabezi buti inguli ka gamba mbabo ka jijulika. Kono ka bajogite abantu, cwale kale bamuleka naka lijila.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Impuzo jo kulifa umutenteko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateu22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka20.20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Mu mashule kale batuma bamwinya baku mafalisi naba ku Elodiyani kwa Jesu, kuka mushakisisa moku mukwatila mu majwi gakwe. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Mi kale bakeza kwakwe no kumuta buti, “Muzigi, tulizi buti uli nkosi gwa conse, tobilaeli ibi bagaja abantu, ukuti to omenenwa ku bantu, kono nijwi lya Nyambe bulyo uziga ubu likalile ka conse. Ku lijelele ukutenteka kwa Sesale kampa buti?<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />“Tulijelele ukutenteka kampa tatu jelele?” Kono Jesu kale aziba buti bantu baliwite imigajo jabo mimangoju, “Cinzi amujeleka kuni shumina?” Muniletele akawaya waya ko mutelo mi mukalete nika bone.”<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Kale baleta akawaya waya, mi kale gaba buza, “Cani ceci icifateo ne zina lin’olitweo?<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Cwale Jesu kale ge bataba buti, “Muwe Sesale ici cijelele Sesale, na Nyambe ici cijelele Nyambe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Mi kale ba komokwa lwini kwakwe.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Impuzo kalyo kubuka kubafwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateu22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka20.27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Cwale Amasaduki aba kaba tyo buti, takuli kubuka ku bafwu, kale bakeza kwa Jesu ne mpuzo. <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />Kale batyo buti, “Muzigi, Mushe naga tun’olela umulao gutyo buti ati mukazi nafwila ku mukwame gwakwe uku talalekiko bana, mukwakwe gwa jojo unkosi ali botele kusesa mufwilwa buti aletele ko lwasi lo mukwakwe.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Mi Koo kabali baloba ba tosanwe na bobile (7), gwe tanzi naga sesa no kufwa nasini kuzala ko mwana, <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Gwabili kale gasesa mufwilwa kono neje kale afwa uku talaleki ko mwana. Naca tendaala nakwa gwetatu, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />mi bonse babo baloba ba tosanwe nabobile (7) naba sesa jojo mwanakazi, mi bonse nokufwa takuli kuleka ko bana. Ku mamaninino naje mwanakazi kufwa. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Cwale mu nako jo kubuka bafwu bonse kubukila ubumi, cwale mwini mwanakazi kuti nabe gwani? Ukuti bonse ba tosanwe na bobile naba musesa.”<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Jesu kale abetaba buti, “Tali buti nityo buti mulafosa, ukuti ta muzekelele ubu kun’olelwe nanga ni nguzu ja Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Abafwu aa naba buke takuli uju nasese kampa kusesigwa, kuti nabakoze sinagwe mangiloi ga kwigulu. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Kono kwaba aba nabafwa no kubuka kwabo, ukuti taa namwabala mwi buka lya Mushe ici naga mulugwila Nyambe aa kakele mucivuna kacijakila, nime Nyambe gwa Abulaama, Nyambe gwa Isaka, ne Nyambe gwa Jakobo. <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Tali ni Nyambe go bafwu kono ni Nyambe gwa baba bajoja. Ao mulilyangene wawa!”<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mulao umunene kuita jimwinya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mateu22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka10.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Jumwinya go bazigi bo mulao kale akeza mi kale abashugwa naba kanana, mukuziba buti Jesu alabatabi nkalabo indotu, kale amubuza buti, “Ku milao jonse mulao nzi gwita jimwinya?”<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Jesu kale ataba buti, “Mulao go butokwa ngugogu, mutegeleze mwema Isilaele! Mfumwetu Nyambe, Numfumu genke bulyo. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Ushake Umfumo Nyambe ko mojo gwako gonse, na ko moya gwako gonse, neko nzunu jako jonse, ne nguzu jako jonse. <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Gwabili gwa kutyo, ushake mukwako sinagwe ubu ulishakila. Takuli mulao gu mwinya guita jeji.”<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Muzigi go mulao kale amutaba buti, “Muzigi, ulatabi nenja, Nyambe neje genke bulyo takuli jumwinya, kono neje bulyo genke. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Ku mushaka ko mojo gwako gonse, no ku shugwisisa kwako konse, ne nguzu jako jonse no kushaka mukwako ubu ulishakila, cintu co butokwa wawa kuita ibitagilo byo kutenta no bitagilo byonse.”<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Mi Jesu aa naga bona buti alatabi nenja, kale atyo kwakwe, “Tokele kule no Mubuso gwa Nyambe.” Mi kuzwao, takuli muntu nanga genke naga zundamina uku buza impuzo.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ni mwanani Mesiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateu22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka20.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Jesu aa kakwesi kuziga mwilapa lyo tempele, kale ababuza, “Cinzi abazigi bo mulao abata buti Mesiya ni mwana Deviti? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Nije wawa Deviti naa gamba ko Moya go Kucena buti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">‘Umfumu naa gamba ku Mfumwangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Ukale kwi ganja lyangu lyo mulyo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Kutwala aa na nitule balwisi bako kwinsi lyo matende gako.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Ije Daviti wawa gasa likuga buti, ‘Mfumu,’ cwale ije buti abotele kuba mwane?” Mi bungi bo bantu kabashaka ku mushugwa.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa Nyansa Bazigi bo Mulao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateu23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luka20.45-47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Jesu aa kakwesi uku ziga kale atyo, “Mu mamele abazigi bo mulao, ba kushaka uku jenda–jenda naba zwesi imikanjo imilee no kushaka uku zuminizwa mwikute mu misika, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Noku shaka kukala abikalo ibilotu mu macinagoge no kushaka ibitulo binene amikiti. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Basa omenena abafwilwa, amanjugo gabo mukuli bonaaza ukulapela amatapelo gabo maale. Kuti naba gwane inkatulo inene wawa kuitilila.”<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umfwilwa aa tagila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luka21.1-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Jesu kale akala amabapa ne cibaka co matagilo, nalolelele abantu naba kwesi kutula masheleni mu citundu ca mwi Tempele. Ubungi bo bantu kaba kwesi lubono kabakwesi kutagila masheleni mangi. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Kono umfwiilwa gwe mpale kale akeza kutula tuwaya–waya tobile utu katutenda bulyo icika lye sheleni. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Jesu kale akuga abazigigwa bakwe no kuta buti, “Zawawa nasa milugwila buti, joju mwanakazi gwe mfwiilwa alatuli lwini mucibikilo kuita abantu bonse. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Balaindi cimwinya kuwa co lubono lwabo kuleka abungi, kono jojo mwanakazi ko bumpale bwakwe alatuli icika kwesi conse aa kajojela.”<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa gamba zo Kumwagala ko Tempele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mateu24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka21.5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Jesu aa kazwa mu Tempele, jumwinya gwaku bazigigwa bakwe kale amubaza buti, “Muzigi, ngolole! Ubunene bwa gago amabwe, no bulotu bo manjugo bobo!”<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Jesu kale ataba buti, “Uliwene jeji mijako minene jonse?” Takuli nanga ibwe limwinya nali kambame ali mwinya, kono gonse kuti naga gwisikizwe ansi.”<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kushuminigwa no mapenzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateu24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka21.7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Jesu aa kakele kumbali ne lundu lyo bishamu bya Olive na lolelele a Tempele, Pitolosi na Jemusi na Joani, na Andreasi kale bamu buza kumbali, <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />“Tulugwile, ni jubanzi aa saka na bitendaale byebi bintu? Mi cisuponzi ici saka na citusunde buti sebi lili afuwi no kutendaala?”<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Jesu kale atyo kwabo buti, “Mu mamele buti takuli nanga genke uju agola kumiomenena. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Abangi kuti nabakeze mwizina lyangu, kuli tunta acizuba buti, ‘Nime!’ Mi bangi kuti baomigwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Aa namu shugwe inkondo ne jaba lyo nkondo, na muleke ku joga. Byebi bintu bi libotele uku tendaala, kono amamaninino ga sikeza. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Ilonga kuti nali lizokele ne ilonga limwinya, muleneni kuti nagu lizokele na muleneni gu mwinya. Mi kuti kube ne nungano je longa mu bibaka bimwinya, ne lukupwe. Kono gaga matatikilo bulyo go mapenzi.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />“Muli jelele kutonda, mi kuti naba mitwale ku makuta ga mu minzi no ku mikabila muma Cinagoge. Kebaka lyangu kuti muzimane abuso bo babusisi no Bamfumu kupaka byangu. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Kono amajwi malotu gali botelwe uku tandazigwa mu malonga gonse. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Nanga aa naba mishumini noku twala kuku zekisigwa, na muleke uku likalililwa byo kugamba. Kono mugambe ibi mulawegwi ke nako jejo, ukuti tali ninwe mugamba, kono Moya go Kucena. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mukulwe go muntu kuti alegeze mwancegwe ku lufwu, neesi alegeze mwane. Abaana kuti balegeze bashemi babo no kubayaga. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Muntu gense kuti amizimbe kebaka lyangu, kono uju azimana mu bugongo ku mamanino kuti ajojeswe.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapenzi manene mwa Jelusalema</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mateu24.15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka21.20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Cwale aa na mubone icintu ci jogisa cimimwaga, nacizimene aa tacibibotele uku kala, uju abala ashugwisise mi ababakele mwa Judeya naba jogele ku Malundu. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />Mi uju aa ngamite acituwa co njugo jakwe, aleke kusezumuka kangina mu njungo, ukuti alindile cintu nanga conke. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Mi uju akele mwigwa aleke ku bogola ku munzi no kainda ingubo jakwe. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Kono ubumpai bwa babo basumbele naba banyonsa abacece mwagago amajuba! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Mukumbile kwa Nyambe buti zezi zintu zileke kutendaala amweo! <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Ukuti gago kuti gabe amajuba go mapenzi kwali kusimwa, ao Nyambe naga bumba ilonga, kuitila ano mi kame taana kube bobo. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />“Ati Umfumu tanala ceisi gagalya majuba, takuli uju najoja. Kono kebaka lya babo naga lishalwila, uju naga lishalwila, mi kale aceisa gago majuba.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Kajejo inako ati muntu gense na gamba kwako, ‘Ngolole, uju ne Mesiya!’ Kampa, ‘Ngolole, julya alyaa’ tozumini bobo. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Bakelesite bo manya no baboni bo manya kuti bali zibahaze, no kutenda ibibi bonahala, no kutenda ibi tendantu byo kuoma, ati naku konaala ba omenene nababo naba kugigwa. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Cwale mumamele, nana mi gambaguza bintu byonse ibi na bikeze kwenu mwi nako ja kubuso.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kukeza ko Mwana Muntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateu24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka21.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />“Kono mwa gago amajuba ubu joge aa sebulamani, ijuba kuti nalisiye, kwezi taa nakulete iseli, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />Intungwezi kuti najigwe kwi gulu, mi nebintu bigwanaala kwigulu byonse kuti nabi nyungane. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Mwajejo inako abantu kuti na babone Mwana Muntu nakeza mu majoba ne nguzu inene no kucena. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Mi kuti natume amangeloi gakwe kugwanika aba naba tumigwa aba na bazwe kumioya jone, kuzwa ku mamaninino ge longa kutwala ku mamaninino ga kwigulu.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Intaluso jo ci shamu co bukuju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateu24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka21.29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Cwale mulizige cimwinya cishamu co bukuju. Intabi jaco aa jitatika kutumpila maani, muzibe buti inako jo nvula sejilisenene. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Nanga ceciba aa mubona byebi bintu bitendaala, muzibe buti sekulili afui ne cinzi. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Za wawa nasa milgwila, lwasi loluno lwa shunu ano taa nalujunde bwita ibintu byonse nabisini kutendaala. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Ilonga ne gulu kuti nalijunde kono majwi gangu tana ga junde.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Takuli uju ezi ijuba kampa inako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Kono kalelyo ijuba kampa inako takuli uju alizekelele, nanga mangeloi ga kwigulu kampa umwana, kono bwita Tata bulyo. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Mutonde mu manyuke! Tamu zekelele jejo inako aa najikeze. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />“Ko kukoza sinagwe muntu ali mulujendo, aa leka injugo jakwe no kuleka mo muika gwakwe buti ajibabalele, muntu no muntu no kuwegwa umusebezi ugu abotele ukutenda no kutela jojo gwa acinzi buti atokomele. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Mi cwale mukale na mulindile ukuti tamuzekelele umwini njugo inako naka bogole, kuti nakube lutengwana kampa kamwi ko malumba kampa silukombwe sala tungula kampa se masiku-siku. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ati nakeza muluzinda naleke kukeza kumugwana na mulele. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Ici nimilugwila nasa cilugwila abantu bonse buti, ‘mumanyuke!”<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Umugajalo go kukwata Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateu26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Joani11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Cwale see kakukele bulyo majuba go bile go kulya umukiti go Mpaseka no kulya Binkwa ibi tabikwesi Umumela, mi amapulisiti abakulu no bazigi bo mulao kame kabakwesi kushaka akaito ko kushumina Jesu no kumwiyaga. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Kono kabatyo buti, “Tuleke kubitenda mwi nako jo mukiti abantu mane naba tuzokele.”<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa singigwa mwa Beteniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mateu26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Joani12.1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Jesu aa kali mwa Beteniya, nabakele antafule mwinjugo ja Simoni gwe cisenda naba kwesi ukulya, kale kwa ngina mwanakazi uju kaindite akazunga alabasitele aka ka kabumbite mafuta ga nunka lwini, aga naga pangigwa asende. Kale amfwinkula icimfwinkiso co kazunga no kusintila amafuta amutwi gwa Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Kono bamwinya aba kabekelemo, kale banyegezwa kwa jejo intaba no kutyo, “Cinzi gaga mafuta ga nunka nenja aa gajonigwa bobo?” <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />“Icilotu kambe nagala gulisigwa antikanyo jo masheleng’i abelekela umubeleki mu mwaka.” Mi jojo mwanakazi kale bamujukukila lwini.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Kono Jesu kale atyo buti, “Mu muleke, cinzi aa mumu kataza? Ala tendi icilotu kwangu! <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Mi kuti namukale na bampale inako jonse, mi kuti namubatende nenja inako jonse iji mushaka. Kono taa namube neme inako jonse. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Alatendi ubu ashakila, mi ala sintili amafuta ganunka nenja amubili gwangu mukuli tukiseza, ime nanisini kuzikigwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Zawawa nasa milugwila buti, ijwi uku litandazigwa mwilonga lyonse, ici alatendi jojo mwanakazi kuti naci gambigwe no kumugaja.”<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judasi aa legeza Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateu26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka22.3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Cwale Judasi Isikaliota jumwinya gwe bekumi nabobile, kale aja ku bapulisita bakulu kalegeza Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Kabajangele buti kuti bashugwe ibi saka gambe, no kumukuluwiza kumuwa amasheleni. Cwale Judasi kale atatika uku shaka akaito ubu ababotele uku batambikila Jesu.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aalya umulalilo go mamaninino</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateu26.17-25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luka22.7-14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Joani13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Mwijuba lyetanzi lyo mukiti gwe Cinkwa tacikwesi mumena, ijuba ka kuyagigwanga ingugana lyo mukiti go Mpaseka, abazigigwa ba Jesu kale bamubuza buti, “Kwibo uku ushaka buti tuka kulukisize kokulila Impaseka?”<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Cwale kale atuma bobile bo bazigigwa bakwe, kale atyo kwabo buti, “Mukaje mukangine mu munzi, mi kuti mu kashangane unkosi uju aindite akazunga ko menzi, muka muumpilile. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Mu njugo umusaka kangine monse, mukatyo ku mwini njugo buti, “Muzigi buti atyo, kwibo jili indandulu umu nibotele ukulila Impaseka na bazigigwa bangu? <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Kuti akamisunde indandulu inene ja kwigulu, jo kulamba nenja, muka tulukiseze ici cibotelwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Abazigigwa kale bakaja mu munzi no kagwana ibintu kobu naabatela Jesu, Mi kale bakalukisa ibilyo lyo Impaseka.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Aa seku latenguwi, Jesu kale akatibelela nabe kumi nabobile. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Mi aa kabekele antafule nabalya, Jesu kale atyo buti, “Zawawa nasa milugwila, jumwinya uju nilya naje, kuti nani legeze.”<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Abazigigwa kale bakala mwinkalilwa, mi kale batatika kumubuza ka genke genke buti, “Tali bunga nime uta?”<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Jesu kale ataba buti, “Jumwinya gwa bekumi nabobile, uju nilya naje icikwa mukasuba konke. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Sinagwe ubu gatyo manolo buti, “Ubumpai bwa muntu na legeze Mwana Muntu, kuli kele nenja ati jojo unoksi taa nazaligwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umulalilo go Mfumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateu26.26-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka22.14-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Aa kaba kwesi kulya, Jesu kale ainda icinkwa, mi aa sala lapeli, kale acikomagula no kucitambika abazigigwa bakwe no kutyo buti, “Mucitambule, gogu mubili gwangu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Mi kale ainda inkomosi, mi aa sala lapeli, kale aji batambika, mi bonse kale banywinamo. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Jesu kale atyo kwabo buti, “Gaga malowa gangu go busele, agaga sintikila abangi.” <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Zawawa nasa milugwila, tanisnywi kame kuci yango co veine, bwita lyelyo ijuba aa nanicinywe mubuya mu Mubuso gwa Nyambe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Aa sebala zimbi ulwimbo, kale baanina kunze kuja kwi lundu lya Olive.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa sukulula byo kushampuligwa kwa Pitolosi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateu26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joani13.36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Jesu kale atyo kwabo buti, “Mwense kuti na mumwagale kunileka nenke, ukuti kuli n’olitwe buti, “Kuti nayage umulisani, mi ingu jonse kuti na jimwagale. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Kono aa senila buki, kuti nani litangize kwenu kungina mucilalanda ca Galileya.”<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Pitolosi kale atyo kwa Jesu, “Nanga naba mwagale bonse, ime taa na nitende bobo.”<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Jesu kale amutaba buti, “Zawawa nasa kulugwila buti, shunu masiku silukombwe nasini kutungula ko bile, igwe wawa kuti uni shampule kotatwe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Kono Pitolosi kale agongolekeza natyo buti, “Nanga nanifwa negwe, taa nani kushampule.” Mi bonse kale bagamba cintu conke.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa lapela mwa Getisemani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateu26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka22.39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Cwale kale bakaja kucibaka ci kugigwa Getisemani, mi Jesu kale atyo ku bazigigwa bakwe buti, “Mukale aano ime nani lapela.” <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Jesu kale ainda Pitolosi na Jemusi na Joani, mi kale atatika kuzikinyeya no kuba munkalilwa. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Mi kale atyo kwabo buti, “Umoya gwangu seguli kokelele kukufwa, mukale aano mi mutonde mu manyuke.”<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Aa sala soneni kulegana, kale agwila ansi no kulapela, ati na kukonaala inako jo mapenzi jibe kule najee. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Abba, Tata Kale atyo, “Conse icintu citole kwako. Utule jeji inkomosi ukule neme. Isini ibi nishaka, kono ibi ushaka.”<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Mi kale abogola ku bazigigwa bakwe kaba gwana balele naba jite an’onzi. Kale atyo kwa Pitolosi buti, “Simoni, Simoni, semulilele? Mwasa kangwa ukutonda mwi nako imfuwi?” <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Mutonde mi mulapele buti muleke uku ngina mu mijeleko. Umoya gula shaka, kono inyama tajigoli.”<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Kame kale akaja kalapela manjwi go kuli koza. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Mi aa kabogola, kame kale abagwana bajite an’onzi, ukuti mensho gabo kagali go kulema. Mi taa kabezi co kugamba kwakwe.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Kale abogola lyatatu, mi kale atyo kwabo buti, “Kame musilele no kuwisa? Kuli lukite! Inako jilasiki. Ngamulole, Mwana Muntu sala tambikwa mu maganja go bantu bo bitendantu bi mangoju. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Mubuke! Ndokweni tujende! Ngamulole umulegezi gwangu alasiki!”<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa shuminigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateu26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Joani18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Ao bulyo aa kasigamba, Judasi jumwinya gwa bekumi na bobile, kale akeza. Mi kajenda no bantu kaba indite mipene no masumo, aba naba tumigwa ku bapulisiti bakulu no bazigi bo mulao no bakulu. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Mi uju kamulegeza naga zumininana icisupo naba yagi buti, “Unkosi uju saka ni kasonsone, neje mubotele kashumina, no kumugonzilila wawa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Ao bulyo Judasi aa sala siki, kale ajililila bulyo kwa Jesu no kutyo, “Muzigi mi kale amu sonsona. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Abankosi kale bakwata Jesu no ku mushumina. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Mi kwababo kabazimene afuwi, kale ainda umupene gwakwe no kukoshola kutwi ko muika go mupulisita mukulu. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Jesu kale aba buza buti, “Cinzi aa mulakezi bufumbatile amasumo ne milamu keza kunikwata sinagwe nili cijoni? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Amajuba gonse kani kalanga nenwe nani ziga mu malapa go Tempele, kono taa namwa nishumina. Kono aman’olo gali botele uku bumbilizwa.”<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Ao bulyo abazigigwa bakwe kale ba mwagala.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Mi kokali umuloba uju taa kajabele cimwinya, bwita isila lyo lineni kalizingite bulyo amubili gwakwe, uju kaumpilile Jesu. Mi kale bamukwata kono kale abaoshoka, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />kono kale abalekela isila lye lineni no kaja magulu mucisense.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa twaligwa ku nkuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mateu26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka22.54-55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Joani18.13-14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Mi Jesu kale ba mutwala ku mupulisita umukulu, uku kaku gwananine abapulisita bakulu bonse no manduna no bazigi bo mulao. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Mi Pitolosi kale amu umpilila nasikali kule gana, no kangina mwilapa lyo Mupulisita mukulu. Mi momo kale akekala no balindili nakwesi kujota umulilo. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Cwale abapulisita bakulu nabo Nkuta bonse, mi kaba shakisisa umulandu ugu babotele kwatwila Jesu ulufwu, kono taa nabagugwana. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Kono bangi bo bampaki bo manya kabakwesi kumuambika ibintu byo manya, kono ubumpaki bwabo taka buzuminana.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Cwale bamwinya bankosi kale bazimana kuwa bumpaki bo manya bwa Jesu, nabatyo, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />“Natwa mushugwa nagamba buti, ‘Kuti nanijakulule jeji Tempele iji naba jaka abantu, mi ime kuti nanijake jingi jo kusajaka no maganja mu majuba gotatwe.’” <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Mi mu bumpaki bwabo taa kaba zuminana.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Mi umupulisita mukulu kale azimana mukati kabo, no kubuza Jesu buti, “Tokwesi inkalabo jo kulilamwina kwebi bakuamika baba bankosi?”<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Kono Jesu kale a ombelele mi taa naataba. Kame mupulisita mukulu kale amubuza buti, “Nigwe Mesiya, Mwana Mfwijaguzi?”<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Jesu kale atyo buti, “Nime, mi kuti na mubone Mwana Muntu nakele kwiganja lyo mulyo lya Sakapanga nakeza mu majoba ga kwigulu.”<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Cwale mupulisita mukulu kale ang’atula ibizwato bakwe. Natyo buti, “Cinzi kame atuzunda umpaki jumwinya?” <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Mula shugwi akashwau. Cwale mugajalo gwenu gwibo? Mi bonse kale bagamba buti alibotele kuyagigwa.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Mi bamwinya kale batatika ku musuwagila mate, no kumuzinga icisila ku mensho, no kumulagula, noku mugonkagula nabatyo, “Ulibuke!” Mi abalibeleli kale ba muinda no kumukaba.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pitolosi aa shampula Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mateu26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka22.56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Joani18.15-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Pitolosi aa kasikele mulapa, jumwinya muika go mukazana go mupulisita mukulu kale akeza, <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />aa naa bona Pitolosi nakwesi kujota umulilo, mukazana kale amulolisa lwini. Mukazana kale atyo buti, “Negwe kokalanga na Jesu gwa Nazaleta.<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Kono Pitolosi kale ashampula buti, “Tanizekelele, mi tanishugwisisi ici ugamba mi kale ananuka no kaanina kucinzi co lapa. Ao bulyo silukombwe kale atungula.<verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Kame umwika go mukazana aa mubona nazimene, kale atyo buti, “Joju unkosi nijumwinya gwabo.” <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Kame kale ashampula. Mwinako imfuwi bulyo aba kabazimene afuwi na Pitolosi kale batyo kwakwe buti, “Ni conse uli jumwinya gwabo ukuti uli Mugalileya.” <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Cwale Pitolosi kale atatika kulikonka no kulifwija buti, “Tani muzekelele joju unkosi uju mugambagula byakwe.”<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Ao bulyo, silukombwe kale atungula lyabili. Cwale Pitolosi kale agaja ijwi lya Jesu ili naa gamba kwakwe buti, “Silukombwe nasini kutungula kobile kuti no nishampule kotatwe.” Mi aa gaja byebyo kale alila.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa twaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mateu27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luka23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Joani18.28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Aa nabwaca amasiku siku, abapulisita abakulu no bakulu, na bazigi bo mulao nabo nkuta jonse jo Majuda kale bazumininana. Mi kale ba shumina Jesu no kumutwala ku ka mutambika mu manganja ga Pilato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilato kale amubuza buti, “Nigwe Umfumu go Majuda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">“Jesu kale ataba buti, “Ula gambi bobo.”<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Abapulisita bakulu kale ba muambika ibintu bingi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilato kame kale abuza Jesu buti, “Totabi cimwinya? Ngolole kame bakwesi uku kuambika ibintu bingi!”<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Kono Jesu kale abula co kutaba, mi Pilato kale komokwa lwini.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa atwilwa ulufwu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateu27.15-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Joani18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Mwi nako jo mukiti go Mpaseka, Pilato ka lukululanga abantu bamwinya aba kaba kumbililwanga bonse. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Unkosi ka kugigwa Balabasi uju naga tuligwa muntolongo na bamwinya, mu mulandu go bwiyagi go kuzokela umubuso. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Mi abantu abangi kale bakeza ku kumbila Pilato ku batendela ici kaba tendelanga mu mwaka. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilato kale abetaba buti, “Mula shaka buti nimi lukulwile Umfumu go Majuda? <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Ukuti kazekelele nenja buti abapulisita bakulu aa bala muleteli Jesu kajili konkole.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Kono abapulisita bakulu kale ba indikiza abantu buti azwise bulyo Balabasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Mi Pilato kame kale aba buza buti, “Cwale buti ni botele uku tendela ku nkosi uju mukuga buti nu Mfumu gwe Majuda?”<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Mi kale ba kumbagana, “Akankaminwe!”<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilato kale aba buza buti, “Cinzi? Bumangojunzi alatendi?” Kono kale bakumba lwini, akankaminwe!”<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Mi Pilato mu kushaka uku jangaza abantu, kale aba lukulwila Balabasi. Mi Pilato kale a lugwila amasole buti bashape Jesu ko ciwepu, no kuba mutambika buti akankaminwe.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masole aa bapengisa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mateu27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Joani19.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Mi amasole kale ba twala Jesu mwi nkuta jo mubusisi kaji kugigwa Pilaetoliyamu, (intaluso ku gwanika akagugi konse ko masole.) <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Kale bamu vwika isila lyo kubiluluka, mi kale bazinga imiga ku mutendela ciusi co Bumfumu no ku mujabika kumutwi. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Mi kame kale batatika ku mukuga buti, “Yoshoo! Mfumu gwe Majuda!” <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Mi kale ba mukaba no lutaka ku mutwi noku mu suwila amate, noku mutongamina. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Mi aa sela munyungululi, kale bamuzinga isila lyo kubiluluka no ku mukolekisa ibizwato byakwe. Mi kale ba mutwala ku kumukankamina.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa kankaminwa acifapaano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateu27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joani19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Unkosi jumwinya gwa kwa Silene, gwe zina lya Simoni isi gwa Alekizanda no Lufusi, uju ka lijendela bulyo mwilonga, kale bamu indikiza uku koleka icifapaano. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Mi kale ba twala Jesu ku ci baka ici ci kugwa Gologota intaluso, “Cibaka ici ci cenite,” <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Kale bamuletela veine jigwanene ne mila, kono taa nagajinywa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Mi kale ba mukankamina, no kuli taila imikanjo jakwe mukutenda in’ela buti uju saka akumbe gense ceco saka agwane. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Sekajili inako jo kamwigana (9:00) Jesu aa naba mukankamina. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Ici naga twilwa ka cin’oletwe buti, “Umfumu go Majuda.” <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Kale kwa kankamina naje no bijoni byo bile, jumwinya ku mulyo ju mwinya ku monsho. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />Mi in’olo ili lityo, “Mi naa kankaminwa ne bijoni” Nalya libumbilizwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Mi aba kabaita munzila, kale bamutukagula nabangunga imitwi jabo nabatyo, “Yaa! Igwe ujakulula Itempele no kujijaka mu majuba go tatwe, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />ulijojise, mi usezumuke aci fapaano!”<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Mi no bapulisita abakulu kale bamusekelela antuonke no bazigi bo mulao bamwinya nabayto, “Kajojisa bamwinya mi taa goli kulijojisa.” <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />“Joju Kilesite Umfumu gwa Isilaele, a suke aci fapaano aano, buti tubone no kuzumina.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Mi nabo naga kankaminwa nabo kale bamu sendagula.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ulufwu lwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateu27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joani19.28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Aa kajili inako jo kamwi (12:00). Ififi kale lya vwika ilonga lyonse, kutwala inako jakuma (15:00). <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Mi mwa jejo inako jo kamwi kuma 15:00. Jesu kale akugiliza mwijwi nene, “Eloi, Eloi lama sabakitani?” Intaluso, “Nyambe gwangu, Nyambe gwangu, cinzi aa unilekelele?”<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Mi bamwinya aba kabazimene afui aa bashugwa bobo, kale batyo, “Mulishugwile, asa kuga Eliya!” <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Jumwinya kale atiga kabumba kazunga ko biponci byo waine no vinega no kucumpwa mo ulutaka no kuwa Jesu buti anywe. Kale batyo, “Mu muleke genke tubone bunga Eliya kuti akeze ku muangulao.”<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Mu kulila mwijwi inene, Jesu kale amina umoya.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Isila lya mu Tempele kale lyan’atuka akati kutatikila kwigulu kutwala kunsi. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mi umukulu go masole uju kazimene abuso bwa Jesu, aa bona ubu afwila kale atyo, “Niwawa joju unkosi kaali Mwana Nyambe!”<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Mi nabanakazi bamwinya aba kabali kule gana bulolelele, mukati kabo mo kaali Maliya Magadalena no Maliya nyina gwa Jemusi mwancegwe gwa Josefa no Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Baba banakazi naba umpilila Jesu mwa Galilea, no kumuwa ibi kashaka, kame no bungi bo banakazi bamwinya aba kabakeza naje mwa Jelusalema nabo ko kabali.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuzikigwa kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateu27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50">Luka23.50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joani19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Aa sekula tenguwi, kajili inako jo kulitukiseza ijuba lyo Nsabata, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Josefa gwa kwa Alimateya, jumwinya kakutekigwa mu nkuta jo Majuda uju kashaka uku bona umubuso gwa Nyambe, kale aba no bundume no kaja kwa Pilato no kakumbila icitupu ca Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Mi Pilato aa shugwa buti Jesu alafwi, kale akomokwa lwini. Kale akuga umukulu go masole no kumubuza buti, “Ati, Jesu kale alafwi?” <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Mi aa salashugwi ku mukulu go masole buti Jesu alafwi, kale azuminiza Josefa kukainda icitupu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Mi Josefa kale agula isila lyo kukebela no kuangula ictupu no kucizingila mwi sila lyo kukebela, no kucitula mwibita lyo kuconkomonwa mwibwe. Mi kale apindumwina ibwe kucinzi ce bita. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Maria Magadalena na Maria nyina gwa Josefa kabalolelele umu katuligwa.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ukubuka kwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateu28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Joani20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Lyo Nsabata aa selilamani, Maliya Magadalena ne Maliya nyina Jemusi na Salome kale bagula amafuta ganunka lwini, buti bakaje no kasinga icitupu ca Jesu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Mwijuba lye tanzi lyo nsunda ijuba aa se lilan’atuli, kale baja kwibita, <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />mi kale balibuzagula mwa cabo, “Nini uju saka akagalumune ibwe kucinzi ce bita?” <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Kono aa balogolosa kale babona buti ibwe ili kalili inene lwini lila galumunwi. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Aa se balaenji mwibita, kale ba bona umuloba nazwesi mu bizwato byo kutuba nazimene ku mulyo, mi kale bakomokwa lwini.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Umuloba kale abata buti, “Muleke ku komokwa, ni Jesu gwa Nazaleta mushaka, uju naga kankaminwa. Ala buki! Tamuli mumuno. Ngamulole umu naba mulalika. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Kono mukaje muka gambaguze bazigigwa bakwe no Pitolosi buti, ‘Gasa jenda abuso bwenu kuja kwa Galileya. Koko kuti na mukamubone kuja ubu naga mitela.<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Mi kale bazwao no kusunduluka kwibita bututuma no kukomokwa lwini ici cilatendaali kwabo, mi kale babula icigambo ukuti naba joga lwini.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 16:8">Jesu aa libonaaza kwa Maliya Magadalena</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mateu28.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">Joani20.11-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Jesu aa sala buki mwijuba lye tanzi lyo Nsunda, kale ga bonaala tansila ku Maliya Magadalena, uju naga zwisigwa amayauma ga toswanwe na gobile (7). <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Kale akaja ka gambaguza aba kabakalanga naje aba kabatondoka no kulila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Aa seba la shugwi buti Jesu mumi, mi Maliya Magadalena ala muboni, taa na bazumina.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ali bonaaza ku bazigigwa bobile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luka24.13-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Ao bulyo kale ga libonaaaza muci bumbigwa cimwinya ku bazigigwa bobile aa kaba kwesi ukujenda mwilonga. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Mi kale ba bogola no kagambaguza bonse, kono taa naba bazumina.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu ali bonaaza kube kumi na kakole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateu28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Joani20.19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Ao Jesu kale ga libonaaza ku bekumi na kakole, aa kaba kwesi ukulya kale aba jukukila kabaka lyo kubula intumelo no myojo mikukutu, ukuti taa naba zumina kwa babo naba mubona nala buki ku bafwu. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Mi Jesu kale atyo kwabo buti, “Mukaje mwilonga lyonse mutandaze amajwi amalotu ku bibumbigwa byonse. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Gense uju azumina no kukolobezigwa kuti na jojesigwe, kono uju tazumini kuti na kanigwe. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Mi kwaba bazumina, aga ngo mamakazo aga naga jende nabo, kuti nabatande amayauma mwi zina lyangu, kuti naba gambe mwindini ja andene andene, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />kuti naba kwate amajoka, mi ati na banywa cintu conse ciyaga taa naci bakubaze, kuti naba tule amaganja gabo abalwele, mi kuti na balwaluke.”<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Jesu aa kambamina kwigulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka24.50-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Cwale Umfumu Jesu aa salamani kugamba kwabo, kale akambamina kwigulu no kakala kwi ganja lyo mulyo lya Nyambe. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Mi abazigigwa kale baja butandaza mwi longa lyonse, mi Umfumu kabeleka nabo noku likolwisisa ijwi ko kuumpilila amamakazo. Ameni.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>